<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">Joshua</book>
  <para style="h">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="mt">Joshua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa suohpa Mosi shi nuain hichi ahing hi a, Mosi panpipa Nun tapa Joshua ahoupia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka suohpa Mosi lah ashita a, tuaziehin tuin thou inlen, nang leh tam mipite zousie, Israel tate kunga kapieh gam zuon dingin tam Jordan galkaita un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi kunga ka gensa bangin, na kengphang un atot khahna gam zousie, ka hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gamdai leh tami Lebanon akipat luipi lien Euphrates luipi tandonga, Hitmite gam zousie leh nitumna lam a tuipilien tandongin na gam uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na damsung siein koima mawngmawng in ahing nang zou sih dinga, Mosi kunga ka um bangin, nang zong ka hing umpi dinga, ka hing zuousan sih dinga, pei zong ka hing peisan sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hattah leh hangsantahin umin, apulepate u’kunga pieh dinga kana chiemsa gam khu agoutan dingun na hawm pieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka suohpa Mosi in dan zousie zui dinga thu ahing pieh zousie zui chinten a bawl dingin, hattah leh hangsantahin um pouma photin: na peina pou a na lamzan zel theina dingin na zietlam ahiei, na veilam ahiei ah, pielsan vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami dan laibuin na kam pawtsan vawt sih heh, hinanleh asunga kigielte zousie na zui chinten a na bawl theina dingin, sun leh zan in na ngaituo zaw ding hi; tuachi’n na lampite ah na tuohpha dinga, tualeh lawchinna hoitah nanei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu ka hing pie hilou amah? Hattah leh hang tahin um in, zau sinlen, lungke vawt sin, Mangpa na Pasian in hing umpi ding ahi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in mipi vaisaite thu apie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Giehphuol sung tuonsuoh unlen, mipite kungah, na neh leh taah ding uh sutuo un, nithum sungin Mangpa na Pasian un, gam luo dinga ahing pieh, luo dingin tami Jordan lui kan ding nahi uhi chi’n, thu pie un, achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Reubenmite, Gadmite leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah Joshua in thu agen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un noute khawldamna ahing peta a, tualeh tam gam ahing peding chia Mangpa suohpa Mosi in thu ahing pieh thei ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na zite u’leh, na taneute u’leh na ganhonte u’pen Mosi in Jordan gal suolampanga ahing pieh gam ah aum ding ua; hinanleh nou mihat hangsante zousie pen na unaute uh masangah napei ding ua, na panpi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa’n noute ahing pieh banga na unaute uh khawldamna apieh masang sie leh Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh gam amauten zong aluo masang sie un: Tuachi’n Mangpa suoh Mosi in Jordan lui gal nisuohna lam gam noute goutan dinga ahing napieh langah na kinuale kia ding ua naluo ding uhi,” chin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh amaute’n “Bawl dinga na hing thupieh zousie ka bawl zel ding ua, tualeh na hing sawlna pou ah zong ka pei zel ding uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sil bangkim a Mosi thu ka zuizel bang un nang thu zong ka zuizel ding uhi: Mosi a umpi bangin Mangpa na Pasian in nang hing umpi phot mai hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koipou na thupieh tunga hel a, na thupieh zui nuomlou pouma khu shisah ahi ding uh, hattah leh hangsan tahin umpouma phot mai in, chi’n Joshua adawng uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Nun tapa Joshua in, “Agam leh adiehin Jeriko khuo aguhin va enkhie un,” chi’n mi ni Shittim mun a kipat in aguh a enkhe dingin asawl hi, tuachi’n ava kuon ua, kizua numei khat amin Rahab kichinu inn ah ava lut ua, khunah atungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh tam thu Jeriko leengpa hilin a umta a, “Ngaiin, tuzanin gamsung enkhe dingin Israel tate lah a mi tammun ah ahing pei uhi,” chi’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeriko leengpan Rahab kungah mi asawl a, “Na inn a hing tung mikhuolte hing pui in, gam sung pumpi aguh a enkhe dinga hingkuon ahi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeinu’n mi nite khu a pui a, aphuolta hi, tuachi’n akung uah tam bangin agenta hi, “Ka kungah mite ahing haw ngutma uhi, hinanleh hei langa kihei mang ahita uoi ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, khomiel kuon a kul kotpi khah hun ding lai velin tua mite apawtkhe kia ta ua, heilang a pei ahi uoi chi ka thei kha nawn sih hi, kintahin delpai u’lachin na delpha nalai ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahivang in amanu’n amaute inntungah a zawpi tou a ziza kung alom lom a, asiekhawmna lah ah aphuolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh miten amaute khu Jordan lui agalkaina tandong ava nuadel ua, tualeh adel mite apawtdoh tahun kul kotpi a khata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh alup masangun amanu khu inntungah akung uah ava peitou a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite kungah, “Tam gam khu Mangpa’n nou ahing peta chi leh na zauhuoina uh ka tung uah ahing tuta a, noute ziehin tam gam a tengte zousie na masang uah azunmang gawpta uh chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin Izipt gam a kipat a na hing pawtdoh laiun, Mangpa’n noute dinga Tuipisan asuhkang dan leh, Jordan gallam a um Amor mite leeng nite, Sihon leh Og na bawl dan u’leh na suhmang dante uh kana zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh kana zah tahun ka lungtangte uh ana zun zouta a, noute zieh in lungzaulou mawngmawng koima aum sih uhi; Mangpa na Pasian ulah tunglam van leh nuoilam lei ah Pasian ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin keiman na tung ua hepina kana suhlat tah ziehin, nou zong ka pa innkuonpi mite tungah na hepina uh hing sulang sam unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka nu leh ka pa, ka sanggam pasalte, ka sanggam numeite leh anei alam zousie uh khawi unlen, shina laha kipat ka hinna uh hing humbitpieh dingin ka kungah kichiem unlen, chiemtena dihtah hing bawl pieh un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh mitegel in adawng ua, akungah, “Ka sil bawl uh mi kunga na gendoh sih ding leh na shi tang un ka shi ding uhi, Tuachi’n hichi ahi ding hi. Mangpa’n gam ahing pieh hun chiengin, ka hing hepi ding ua, na tungah muonhuoi tahin kabawl ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n amautegel kotta ah khauhuolin akhaikhesuhta a; a inn lah kulbang tunga um ahi ngal a, tualeh amanu khu kulbang tunga teng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n akung uah “Muollam zuon in peita un khuchilou in ahing nuadelten ahing mukha ding uhi, ahing nuadelte hing kinuale kia masangsie’n ni thum sung kiphuol un; tuazou chiengin napei kia na ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n mite gel in akungah; “Na hing kichiem sahna pen, na chitahtah ahisihleh amaw ka posih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngaiin, gamsung ka hing lut chiengun, tam na hing khaikhiehsuhna khau sandup kotta ah nakhi inlen, tualeh na kungah na nu, na pa, leh na sanggam pasalte leh na pa innkuonte zousie na inn a nana puilut ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi ding a, na inn kotpi a kipata kholai a pawtkhe pouma sisan maw ama lutungah aum dinga, kouten a maw ka posih ding uhi, tualeh koipou innsunga na kung a um pouma tunga khut kihakha aumleh asisan maw uh ka lutung uah aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh ka sil bawl uh na gendoh leh nang kichiem sahna thu ah mawsiet in ka umsih ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n “Na gen bangbang uh hita heh achia,” tuachi’n amautegel asawldohta a apeita uhi, tuachi’n amanu’n akotta ah khau sandup akhita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amautegel apeita ua, muol ahing tung ua, anuadelte ahing kinuale kia masangsie un khum mun ah nithum sung a umta uhi, tualeh anuadelten lampi tungtawn in amaute asui ua, hinanleh amuzou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi nite khu ahing kile kia ua, muol tunga kipat in ahing kumsuh ua, tualeh agalkai ua, Nun tapa Joshua kung ah ahing tung ua, sil tung zousie a kung ah ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh amaute gelin Joshua kungah Mangpa’n gam pumpi ikhut uah ahing pe tahtah ta hi; a ziehpen eite ziehin a gam sung ua teng mi zousie achitun siengta uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua zingmawng matah in athou a, Israel tate zousie toh Shittim mun akipat in akisuon ua, Jordan lui ava tung uhi; agalkai masang un khum mun ah agieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, nithum nuain, a lamkaite un giehphuol ava tuon suoh sieng ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian uh thuhun bawm leh Levi mite siemputen tami azawn uh namu chiengun, na umna ua kipat in na kisuon ding ua, na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahivang in noute leh tami thuhun bawm kikaal tethaw in tong tul ni vela akigamlat ding ahi, na peina lampi ding uh na thei theina dingun, a naiah hing pei sih un, aziehpen tami lampi tumasang lamin na zuikha ngai nai sih uhi,” chi’n thu apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in mipite kungah, “Kisusiengthou un, aziehpen zing chiengin Mangpa’n nalah uah sillam dang tah bawl ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in siempute kungah, “Thuhun bawm zawng unlen, mipite masangah galkai un” chi’n agen hi. Tuachi’n amaun thuhun bawm a zawng ua mipite masangah apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua kung ah, “Mosi ka umpi bangin nang zong ka hing umpi ding hi, chi athei theina dingun, tuni’n Israel zousie mitmu ah nang ka hing pahtawi pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh thuhun bawm zawng siempute kung ah, Jordan lui gei na hing tun chiengun, Jordan lai ah na din dide ding uh ahi, chi’n thu na peding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in Israel tate kungah, “Talang ah hing pei unlen Mangpa na Pasian u’thu hing ngaikhie un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in “Tanah Pasian hing na lah uah aum a, na masang uah Kanaanmite, Hitmite, Hivmite, Periz-mite, Girgashmite, Amormite leh Jebusmite a delmang ngeingei ding chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngaiun leitung pumpi Mangpa thuhun bawmin na masang uah Jordan lui akan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Israel nam lah apat in, namchin lah a pat in, nam khat thahengin mi khat zel, mi sawm leh ni telkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hidinga, Mangpa, leitung pumpi Mangpa bawm zawng siempute kephangin Jordan tui atotkhah tahin, Jordan tui sahlam a kipat a hing luongsuhte a kipat in ahing kangtan dinga, ahing kiching venvon ta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, mipite Jordan luigal kaidingin apuonbuhte ua pat in ahing pawtdoh ua, siemputen mipite mai ah thuhun bawm zawngin apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh bawm zawngte Jordan lui ahing tung ua, bawm zawng siempute kengin tui mong atot tahin; (aziehpen bu lahhun sungteng Jordan lui akuong dimlet in aluong zing hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sahlam a kipata hing luongsuh tuite akhawlta a, gamla kuomtah a Zerethan gamgi zula um Adam khuo tandongin akiching venvon a, tualeh Arabah tuipi, Tuipi Al lam a luongsuh lai akangtanta a, tuachi’n mipite Jeriko kho gal tah ah agalkaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thuhun bawm zawng siempute Jordan lui lai a leigaw tungah, mipite zousie Jordan lui agalkai sieng masangsie un ading denta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, mipi zousien Jordan lui agalkai sieng zou un, Mangpa’n Joshua ahoupi a, a kung ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipite lah apat mi sawm leh ni, nam tenga mi khat zel teldoh inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a kung uah, Jordan luilai a siempute dinna laitah a suong sawm leh ni la unlen, gieh phuol tuzan a na giehna ding mun uah koi un, chi’n thupie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in Israel tate lah a mi sawm leh ni, nam tenga mi khat zel atelkhiehte ahan a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in akung uah, “Mangpa na Pasian uh bawm masangah Jordan luilai ah galkai unlen, Israel tate nam phaza dungzui in michin in suong khat chiet la unlen na liengkou uah puo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n tamte na lah uah chiemte na ahing hidinga, tunua chienga na tate un, Tam suongte nou a dinga bang na china uh ahiei chia ahingdoh hun chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nouten akung uah, Mangpa thuhun bawm masangah Jordan tuite ahing kangsan a, Jordan lui agalkai lai in, Jordan lui tuite ahing kichingtan ta hi, tuachi’n tam suongte khu Israel tate adingin kumtawnna theizingna ahi ding hi; chi’n na dawng ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua kunga thu agen bangin, Israel taten Joshua thupieh bangin abawl ua, Israel tate nam phaza dungzuiin Jordan luilai apat in suong sawm leh ni ala ua, agiehna mun uah apophei ua, khum mun ah akoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Thuhun bawm zawng siempute dinna lai tah, Jordan luilai ah khum suong sawm leh nite aphut a, khumte tuni dongin aum nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Joshua thu apieh zousie banga, Mangpa’n mipite kunga bawl ding a, Joshua thu apieh zousie abawlzou sieng masangsie uh, siempu bawm zawngte Jordan luilai ah ading den ua, tuachi’n mipite akinaw ua agal kaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, mipi zousie agalkai siengzou nua un, Mangpa bawm leh siempute mipi mitmu in agalkai ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben tate, Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte, Mosi in akung ua agenzousa bangin Israel tate masang ah galvan a kivon in agalkai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Galdou dinga kimansa mi tul sawmli vel, Jeriko phaijangte ah Mangpa masangah agalkai uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khumi ni’n Mangpa’n Israel mi zousie mitmu in Joshua apahtawita a, Tualeh amauten Mosi agiin bangun Joshua zong adamsungteng agiingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua ahoupi a, akung ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Theipina umna bawm zawng siempute Jordan lui a kipat ahing pawtdohna ding un thu pie in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in siempute, “Jordan lui akipat hing pawtdoh ta un chi’n” thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hi a, Mangpa thuhun bawm zawng siempute Jordan lui lai a kipat in ahing pawtdoh ua, tualeh siempute kephangin leigaw ahing tot tahun, Jordan tuite amasanga bangin aluon ngaiin ahing luong kia a, akuom zousie ah aluongdim kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite ha khatna ni sawmni in Jordan lui a kipat in ahing pawtdoh ua, Jeriko suolam a um Gilgal ah giehphuol abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Jordan lui akipata ahing puoh uh, khum suong sawmlenite khu Joshua in Gilgal ah aphut ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in Israel tate kungah thu agen a, “Tunua chienga na tate un apate uh kunga, tam suongte bang china ahiei? chia adoh chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel tate tam Jordan lui ah tuolgaw tungah ahing gal kai uhi, chi’n na tate uh na hing theisah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian un nidanglai a igalkai zou sieng masangsie ua, imasang ua Tuipi san ana kangtansah mabangin Jordan tuite na galkai zou sieng masangsie un na masang uah akangtansah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leitunga mizousie in Mangpa khut ahat ahi chi atheinading u’leh, Mangpa na Pasian uh kumtawna na giin theina ding un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Jordan luigal tumlam a um Amormite leengte zousie leh Tuipi gei a um Kanaanmite leengte zousie’n igalkaizou masangsie uh, Mangpa’n Jordan tuite Israel tate masangah akangtan sahta hi chi ana zah un, Israel tate ziehin alungtanguh ana zun zouta a, tualeh achizalou koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Mangpa’n Joshua kung ah “Meisa suong temta hiemtah bawl inlen, Israel tate tep aniveina tanpieh kia in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in meisa suong temta hiemtah abawla, Gibeath ha araloth ah Israel tate tep atan piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in atep uh atanpiehna zieh khu tami ahi, Izipt gam a kipata hing pawtdoh pasal galkap thei zousie, Izipt akipat ahing pawtdoh nua un lamkaal ah gamdai ah ashi beita uhi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat a hing pawtdohte zousie ahileh teptansa ngen ahi ua, hinanleh Izipt gam a kipat ahing pawt lai ua lamkaal a gamdai a piengte zousie khu teptanlou ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Izipt gam akipat ahing pawtdoh galkap thei mi zousie, Mangpa aw angaikhiet utlou zieh ua thalia a aum sieng masangsie un, Israel tate khu gamdai ah kum sawm li sung a viel vahta uhi, tua mite kungah Mangpa’n nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam pieh dinga ahing chiem khu amusah sih ding hi, chiin ana kichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n atate uh amaute thahenga adindoh sahte Joshua in atep uh atan pieh hi, lamkaal a atep uh atanpiehlou ziehin teptanlou ana hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, mipite zousie tep atan zou un, adam masangsie un, giehphuola aumna mun chiet uah a um dentadi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Joshua kung ah, “Tuni’n Izipt miten noute ahing simmawna uh nouma ua kipat in kalia mangta hi,” achi hi. Tuaziehin khum mun min khu tuni tandongin Gilgal akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Gilgal ah giehphuol asat ua, Jeriko phaijangah khum ha ni sawm leh li niin peikan pawi amang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh peikan pawi zou azingni mama in agam a pieng tanghou tolsawlou leh vaimim kante ane uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh khum gam a pieng bu aneh zingmawng ua kipat in manna ake nawn sih a, Israel taten manna zong amu nawnsih uhi, khumi kum in Kanaan gam bulebal ane zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Joshua Jeriko khogei a aum laiin adahtou a, a en a, tualeh ngaivawi amai toh kitangin mi khat a namsau dawsa a khuta tawi a ding amu a, tuachi’n Joshua in ava zuon a, akungah, “Kou langa pang na hiei, ahisihleh ka melmate ulanga pang?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Hilou e, Mangpa galkapte lamkai dinga hing pei ka hi zaw hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Joshua amai a tuolsu in akhupboh a, abie a, akungah “Ka Mangpa’n asuoh kungah bang gen ding nei a tai leh?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa galkapte lamkai pa’n Joshua kungah “Na kengphang akipat na kengdap sutkhie in, na dinna mun mun siengthou ahi,” achi a, tuachi’n Joshua in tuabang in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Jeriko khu Israel tate ziehin akikhah bih beh a; koima apawtdoh sih ua, koima zong a lut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua kung ah, “En in, Jeriko khopi leh aleengpa u’leh amihat hangsante uh na khut ah ka hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na galkapmi zousie in khopi khatvei nava kimvel suoh phot ding ua, khumbanga ni guhsung na bawl dinguh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh siempu sagi in bawm masangah belamtal kii pengkul sagi atawi ding uhi; tuachi’n ani sagi niin khopi sagi vei navel suoh ding ua, siemputen pengkulte amut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, belamtal kii pengkul amut ging uh na zah chiengun mipi zousie aw ngaitahin akikou ding ua, tuachi’n khopi kulpi achimzah dinga, mipite amauh mazawn chietah tangtah in apei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nun tapa Joshua in siempute ahan a, akung uah “Thuhun bawm zawng unlen siempu sagiin, Mangpa bawm masangah belamtal kii pengkul tawi u’hen achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh aman mipite kungah “Peizel unlen khopi vel suohun, tualeh mi galthuom a kithuomte Mangpa bawm masangah pelzel uhen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hita a, Joshua in mipite kunga thu agen zou in, Mangpa masanga belamtal kii pengkul sagi tawi siempu sagite apei zel ua, pengkul amut ua, Mangpa thuhun bawm in azui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh galthuom a kithuom mite khu pengkul mut siempute masangah apei ua, tualeh anualam vengte bawm nua ah apei ua, siemputen apeikawmun pengkul amut zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in mipite kungah, “Kikou dinga thu ka hing pieh ni atun masangsie, na kikou dinguh ahisih a, na aw u’zong zah ahi lou ding ahi, tualeh na kam ua kipat in thu mawngmawng pawtsih heh, khum ni chiengin na kikou nading uhi chi’n thu apie hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa bawm in khopi kimvel in khat vei avelsuoh sah a, tuazou chieng giehphuol ah ahing pei ua, giehphuolah ahing gieh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua zingmawng matahin athou a, siemputen Mangpa bawm azawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa bawm masangah belamtal kii pengkul tawi siempu sagite apei zel ua, pengkul amut ua, tualeh galvan a kivon mite amaute masangah apei ua, tualeh anualam vengte, Mangpa bawm zawngte nua ah ahing pei ua, siemputen a peikawm un pengkul amut zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ani ni in khopi khat vei avelsuoh kia uhi, khum bangin ni guhsung abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, ani sagi niin zingmawng phalvahin athou ua, abawl ngaima bangun sagi vei avel suoh uhi, khum ni maimai in khopi sagivei avel suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh a sagi veina ah hichi ahing hi a, siemputen, pengkul amut tahun, Joshua in mipite kung ah “Kikou un Mangpa’n khopi nou ahing pe zou ta hi, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam khopi leh asunga um zousie Mangpa a dinga hamsethuoh leh suhmang thang dinga kipesa ahita, Rahab kizuanu leh a innsunga akunga um zousiete pen, imi sawlte ana phuol ziehin ahing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh nou pen hamselaw silte akipat kihemkhie un, khuchilou in khum hamselaw sil na lah u’leh hamsethuoh in na umkha ding uhi, tualeh Israelte giehphuol khu hamsethuohin na umsah kha ding ua, lungkham leh mangbangin na um kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh sana, dangka, sum-eng leh sia leh umlebelte zousiete a un in Mangpa tanvou ngen ahi a, Mangpa sumbuh a koi ahi ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n siemputen pengkul amut tahun akikouta ua, tualeh hichi ahing hi a, mipiten pengkul ging azahtah un, tualeh mipite aw ngaitah a akikou tahun, kulpi bang khu achimkhe zengzungta hi, tuachi’n mipite ama uh mazawn chiet ah tangtahin khopi sung alut chiet ua, khopi khu alata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh khopi sung a um zousie, numei leh pasal, aneu alien, bawngtalte, belamte, sabiltungte a un in namsauin athatgam kilkel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Joshua in gam enkhedinga vakuon mi nite kungah, “Tua kizuanu inn sungah valut unlen, akunga nava kichiemna bangun, khum numei anei alam zousie toh hing puidoh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n gam vil a kuon tangval tegel khu avalut ua, Rahab, anu apa leh asanggam pasalte leh anei zousie toh ahing puidoh ua, asanggam, aunau zousie zong ava puidoh ua, Israelte giehphuol pulam ah aum sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh khopi leh asunga um zousiete khu mei in ahaltum sieng ua, Sana, dangka, sum-eng leh sia, tualeh tui um belsuonte maimai Mangpa sumbuh ah akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahivang in Joshuain kizuanu Rahab leh apa innkuonpite zousie leh anei zousie ahinkhawi a, tuachi’n tunitanin Israelte lah ah ateng denta uhi; Jeriko khuo enkhe dinga Joshua in asawlte ana phuolguh ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in khum hunlai in, “Tam Jeriko khopi hing tungding kia pouma Mangpa masangah hamsiet in um heh, “Ata masapen luong toh ainn suongphum phumkhawm henlen, ata tumpen luongtoh akulkotpite alemkhawmta heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Joshua a umpi a, tualeh agam pumpi ah ahing minthangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel taten hamselaw silte ah ahing takhielta ua, Juda nam a Zerah tapa, Zabdi tapa, Karmi tapa Akan in hamselaw sil sienglou ana lata a, tuachi’n Israel tate tungah Mangpa a lungthahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in Jeriko apat in Bethel suolam a Beth-Aven kho kunga um Ai khuo ah mi asawl a, akung uah, “Va peitou unlen gam va en khie un” achi a, tuachi’n mite ava pei ua, Ai khuo khu ava enkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Joshua kungah ahing kile kia ua, akungah “Mi zousie kuontouse da uhen mi tul ni ahiei tul thum ahiei, va kuontou uhenlen, Ai khuo va sim uheh, mi zousie va suhgim se ngai sih va, tawmnoukhat ahibou uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite lah apat mi sang thum dingvel a kuontou ua tualeh Ai mite masangah ataithangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Ai miten mi sawmthum le guh vel ana that ua; kulpi kot gei a kipat in Shebarim tandongin ahing nuadel ua, akumsuhna ah athabe nalai uhi. Tuaziehin mipite lungtang ahing zun zouta a, tui bang mai ahing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in apuonte abotkeha, Mangpa thuhun bawm masangah ama leh Israel upate amai ua tuolsu in nitahlam tandongin abohkhup ua, tualeh alutung uah leivui akibuohkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in “Tamoh zangde izaw! Mangpa Pasian aw bang dinga suhmangthai ding giapa, Amor mite khut a piehlut dinga Jordan lui na hing pui galkai mama ata diei, Jordan lui gal a lungkim taha um khinkhian zawhmaiding hia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Israelte hichi banga, a melmate uh masanga ataizah taah mai u’khu bang kalawta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kanaanmite leh tam gam sunga tengte zousie in aza ding ua, ahing im ding ua, leitunga kipat ka min uh sumang ding hita ve un maw? Na min thupitah khu bang nalawta diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Joshua kungah, “Thou in bangdinga hichibanga bohkhupa lum den na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israelten sil abawl khiel ua asieimah, tualeh akung ua zui dinga ka pieh ka thuhun khu abotseta uhi, aziehpen amaun hamselaw silte themkhat nasan ala nalai ua, guh zong agu nalai uhi, tualeh a im bawl ua, avan lahte uh aphuol nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuazieh in ahi, Israel tate agalte uh masanga ding zoulou a, ataizah na uh, azieh pen amaute hamselaw ahita uhi; hamselaw silpen na lah ua kipat na suhmang phot sih u’leh na kung uah ka um nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thou inlen mipite susiengthou in, tualeh akung uah zing chienga dingin kisusieng un; Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi; “Na lah uah hamselaw sil a um hi, Aw Israel na lah ua pat a khum hamselaw sil na lahmang masangsie uh, na galte uh na zouthei sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin zingmawng chiengin, anam anam in na hing kilang ding ua, tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Mangpa’n amatdoh nam khu aphung aphung in ahing kilang ding ua, Mangpa’n amatdoh phung khu a innkuon kuon un ahing pei ding ua, Mangpa’n ana matdoh innkuon khu amimal mal in ahing pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, koipou hamselaw sil la a kimankha pouma khu ama pum in anei zousie toh mei a haltum ahi ding, Mangpa thuhun abawsiet zieh leh Israelte lah a silgilou mothuoitah abawlziehin achi hi chi’n gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua zingmawng matahin athoudoh a, Israel tate anam anamun ahing kilang sah a, tuachi’n Juda namte mat ahing hita ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda namte ahing kilang sah kia a, tuachi’n Zerah phung mat ahita a, tualeh Zerah phungte ami mal mal in ahing kilang kia ua, tuachi’n Zabadi mat ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ami mal mal in ahing kilangsah kia a, tuachi’n Juda nam a Zerah tapa, Zabadi tapa, karmi tapa Akan khu mat ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in Akan kungah, “Ka tapa Mangpa Israelte Pasian kungah thupina pie inlen, akungah na khelna phuongin, na Silbawl hing hilin, kei kungah im vawt sin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Akan in Joshua adawnga, akungah, “Mangpa Israelte Pasian tungah sil kana bawl khielta ngut ngei hi, tambangin ahi kana bawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gal vanlahte lah a Babilon puon hoitah leh dangka shekel zani, sana tang shekel sawmnga buh ka mu a ka enla senga kana lata mawh hi, tualeh ngaiin ka puonbuh sunga lei a ka guhphuol ahia, dangka pen khumi nuoi ah a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in mite asawl a, puonbuh sungah ava tailut ua, tualeh ngaiin puonbuh sungah ana phuol ngut ngei a, anuoi ah dangka a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh tua silte khu puonbuh apat in ahing ladoh ua, Joshua leh Israel tate zousie kung ah ahing tawi ua, tualeh Mangpa masangah ahing luikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua leh Israelte zousie’n Zerah tapa Akan leh a dangka te, puonsilte, sana tangte, atapate, atanute, abawngtalte, asabiltungte, abelamte, apuonbuhte leh aneizousiete toh aman ua, Akor guom ah ahing puitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in “Bangdinga hing sumangbang na hiei? Mangpa’n tuni’n nang zong ahing sumangbang sam ding ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Israelte zousie in ama suongin asep ua, tuazouin meiin ahal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n atungah suong a sepvum venvon ua, tunitanin aum nalai hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa khu alungthahna zauhuoitah akipat akiheita hi. Tuaziehin khum mun min khu tuni tandongin Akor guom akichi denta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua kungah, “zau sinlen, lungke vawt sin, Thou inlen, galkap thei zousie pui inlen, Ai khuo ah kuontou in, Ngaiin Ai khuo leengpa leh amite leh akhuo leh agam, na khut ah ka hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeriko khopi leh a leengpa utunga nabawl bangin, Ai khuo leh aleengpa tungah zong na bawl ding ahi, gallah salte leh gantate maimai na tanvou dingun na kilah ding uhi, khopi aguh a buh dingin anua langah mi koidapin;” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua leh galkap theiteng zousie, Ai khuo lam a kuontou dingin akisata ua, tualeh Joshua in mihat hangsan sang sawmthum ateldoh a, zanlai in asawltouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Ngai un, khopi sim dingin khopi nualangah nana guh pan ding uh ahi, khopi apat gamla pei sengsih unlen, hinanleh kimansain um chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n kei leh ka kunga umte zousie in khopi kava zuon ding ua, tualeh hichi ahing hidinga, amasa a abawl bang ua eite dou dinga ahing pawtdoh chiengun amasang uah itai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n eite nuadel dingin ahing pawtdoh ding ua, khopi akipat gamla simtah ihemhah masang sie un, amaun tumasanga mabangin imasangah taizahta u’e ahing chi ding ua; tuachi’n amasang uah itaizah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n na buhdapna mun ua pat na hing pawtdoh ding ua, khopi nala ding uhi, Mangpa na Pasian un na khut uah ahing pekhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, khopi na lah chiengun, khopi khu mei in na hal ding ua, Mangpa thupieh bangin na bawl ding uhi; Ngaiun, thu ka hing peta hi,” chiin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in a sawldoh ta hi, tuachi’n amaute aguh a buhdap dingin akuonkheta uhi, Bethel leh Ai khuote kikaal ah, Ai khuo tum lam ah ava um uhi, Joshua pen khum zanin mipite lah ah agieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua zingmawng matahin athoudoh a, mipite asim a, tualeh ama leh Israel upate khu mipite masangah Ai khuo lam zuon in apeitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh akunga galkap thei mipi umte zousie akuontou ua, ava zuon ua, khopi kung naitah ah ahing tung ua, tualeh Ai khuo mallam pangah giehphuol abawl uhi, Ai khuo toh akikaal uah phaihawm a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh aman mi tulnga ding vel azawpi a, khopi tumlam pangah Bethel leh Ai khuo kikaal ah aguh a buhdap dingin mi akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh galkap mipihon zousie mallam pangah a koi a, tualeh anualam veng dingte khopi tumlam ah a koi zou tahun, Joshua pen khum zanin phaihawm laitah ah ava pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Ai khopi leengpan khum thu atheitahin, zingmawng matahin ama leh khum khopi a um mite kintahin athou ua, amun guotna mun uh phaijang ah Israelte doudingin akuonta uhi, hinanleh khopi nualangah amaute aguh a buhdap a um hi chi athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua leh Israelte zousie amasang uah guollel banga kibawlin, gamdai lampi langah ataita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ai khuo a um mi zousie amaute del dingin akihankhawm ua, tualeh amauten Joshua anua delta ua, tuachi’n khopi apat gamla simtah hemhahin a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte nuadel a pawtdohlou Ai leh Bethel ah mi khat zong a um tasih a, khopi ahawmin anuasieta ua, Israelte anuadelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua kungah, “Tua na khuta na teipi tawi Ai khuo lam ngain lehtou in, na khuta hingpe ding kahi,” a chia. Tuachi’n Joshua in akhut a ateipi tawi khu Ai khuolam ngain alehtou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh aguh a buhdap mipite apanmun ua kipat in ahing pawtdoh ua, akhut azah tahin ahing tai ua khopi sungah alut ua, ala ua, kintahin khopi khu mei in ahalta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Ai miten anualang uh a et u’leh, Ngaivawi khopi ki halna mei khu vanlam a zamtou ngei ngui amu ua, tuachi’n amauten heilangheilanga taitheina thalezung mawngmawng aneita sih uhi, tualeh gamdai lam a taiten amauh nuadelte khu ana le nuadelta mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua leh Israelte zousie in, aguh a pangten khopi alata uh chi leh khopi kihalna meikhu vanlam a zamtou amu tahun akinuahei ua, Ai mite athatta uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amauh dou dingin khopi sunga pat midangte ahing pawtdoh ua, tuachi’n Israelten akalte ta ua, akimkhatte alang khat ah, kimkhat dangte ale lang khat ah aum ua, tuachi’n athat ua, khat zong hing khawilouin leh suohtalou in a satlia siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Ai khopi leengpa pen ahingin aman ua, Joshua kungah ahing pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Israelten Ai khomi gamlah a um zousie, gamdai a ava nuadelna mun ua atha zou ua, tualeh aunpi ua namsau a avatha nua un, Israel mi zousie Ai khuo ah ahing kile kia ua, namsau in athatgamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi a, khum nia shi Ai khuo mite numei pasal aunpi un tul sawm leh tul ni ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ai khuo a teng mi zousie thachimit ahi masangsie’n Joshua in ateipi ale touna akhut anua koisuh kia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mangpa’n thu apieh a, bawl ding achi bangbangin khum khopi a gantate leh gallah silte maimai Israelte adingin, ama u’tantuom dingin akilahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshuain Ai khuo ahal a, kumtawna dingin leisevum in abawla, tunitan in koima tenlouna asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Ai khuo leengpa khu nitah dongin singdawn ah akhai a, tualeh ni atum tahin Joshua in aluong sing dawn apat lakhe dingin thu apie a, khopi kulkotpi lutna ah aluong apai ua, atungah suong asevum venvon ua, tuni tandongin a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khumi’n Joshua in Israelte Mangpa Pasian a dingin Ebal muolah maitam abawla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mangpa suoh Mosi in Israel tate thu anapiehsa Mosi dan laibu a kigiel bangin “Koiman atunga seh alap khahlou suong kikheng hiloua kilem maitam abawla; Tuami tungah Mangpa a dingin halmang sillat leh lemna sillatte alan uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh khunah Israelte mitmu mama a Mosi in dan gelsate, suong tungte ah atei sawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte zousie, a upate u’leh, a houtute u’leh, avaihawm te u’toh, bawm le lampang tuohtuoh ah, Mangpa thuhun bawm zawng siempu Levite leh, gamdang mite leh alah ua piengte, ading khawm chiet ua, akimkhat Gerizim muol zawn ah, akimkhat Ebal muol zawn ah, Mangpa suoh Mosi in Israel tate a guolzawl ding uh hi chia masanglai a thu ana pieh bangin ading sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuazou in Joshua in danthute zousie guolzawlna leh samsietnate, dan laibu sunga kigiel zousie dungzui in asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in Israel mipi kikhawmte zousie, numeite, naupangte leh alah ua um gamdang mite masanga asimlou Mosi thupieh khat zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Jordan gal tumlam pang a, muol tungate leh muol zul gamngiemlah leh Lebanon mazawn a um tuipi lien panga teng Hitmite, Amormite, Kanaanmite, Perizmite, Hivmite leh Jebusmite leengpate zousie in tam thu azah tahun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua leh Israelte dou dingin lungsim munkhat puoin akikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Gibeon a tengten Joshuain Jeriko leh Ai tunga asil bawl azah tah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pil lepchie tahin agamta ua, tualeh apei ua, palai sawl bangin akibawl ua, ip luipipi asabiltungte uh aposah ua, uoin thawl lui kehsa leh ip kiphaw nemnomte bang a keng ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kengtawdap lui kiphaw nemnomte abut ua, tualeh puon sesate asil uhi, tualeh aneh ding ua atanghou puohte uh agogemgom, ap khetkhut a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Gilgal giehphuol ah Joshua kungah ahing pei ua, akungah leh Israelte kungah, “Gamla tah a kipata hing pei ka hi ua, tuin koute toh thuhun bawl un a chi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel miten akung uah, “Ka lah ua teng na hikhamawsih ding uhi, bangchin noutoh thuhun kabawl thei ding uoi?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Joshua kungah “Na suohte kahi uh” achi ua, tuachi’n Joshua in akung uah “Koite nahi uoi? tualeh heia hing kipan nahi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Mangpa na Pasian min ziehin na suohte gamlapitaha hing kipan kahi uhi, aziehpen Amin than dan leh Izipt gam a asilbawlte leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan gal a um Amormite leeng nite, Heshbon leengpa Sihon leh Ashtaroth a um Bashan leengpa Og tunga asilbawl zousie kana za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka upate u’leh ka gam sung ua tengte zousie in ka kung uah, na zin na lampi ua naneh ding uh keng unlen amauh vahoupi unlen, akung uah, “Na suohte kahi uh, tuaziehin tuin koute toh thuhun bawl un, nachi ding uhi,” chiin a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam ka neh ding ua ka hing tanghou puoh u’khu na kung ua hing hawdinga ka hing kipatdoh ni ua, ka guon laiun alum nalai ahia, hinanleh en un tu’n vang agawta a, a ap siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh tam uoin thawlte khu atha a ka hing thun uh ahia, tualeh en un akehta hi, tualeh tam ka puonsilte u’leh ka kengtodapte u’zong ka hing peina uh agamlat seng ziehin alui gawpta hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh miten anehding ken uh ala ua, hinanleh Mangpa kung ah thuhilna angen sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in amautoh lemna abawl a, amaute hingkhawi dingin thuhun abawl hi; tualeh mipi kikhawm lamkaiten zong akung uah thu achiem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh amautoh thuhun abawl nua uh nithum zou in hichi ahing hi a, amaute khu akung nai ua mi ahi ua, alah ua teng ahi uh chi ahing theidohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate apei zel ua, nithum ni in a khopite uh ahing tungta uhi. Akhopite uh ahileh Gibeon, Kephirah, Beeroth leh Kirjath-Jearim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh mipi kikhawmte lamkaiten Israelte Mangpa Pasian min a akung ua thu ana chiemtah ziehun Israel taten amauh adousih uhi. Tualeh mipi kikhawmte, lamkaite tungah aphunta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n lamkaite zousie in mipikikhawmte zousie kung ah, “Israelte Mangpa Pasian min in akung uah ina kichiemta ua, tuaziehin tuin ama uh ikhoikha thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tambangin atung uah i bawl ding uhi, akung ua ithuchiemna ziehin hingkhawi mai vai, khuchilouin itung uah lungthahna ahing tungkha ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh lamkaite’n akung uah “Hingkhawi in um u’henlen, hinanleh amaute khu mipite zousie ding a, singtom leh tuitawiin pang uheh, lamkaite’n akung ua ana chiemtah mabangun,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in amaute ahansah a, akung uah, ka lah ua teng hinapi a, “Bang dinga gamlapi a kipat a hing pei kahi uh chia hing sol nahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin hamsethuoh na hita uhi, na lah ua mi khatbeh zong suoh hilou dinga zalen na umsih ding ua, ka Pasian inn adinga singtom leh tuitawi in napang ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Joshua adawng ua, “Mangpa na Pasian in a suoh Mosi kunga gam zousie na kung ua hing peding leh gamsunga teng zousie na masang ua kipat a sumang dinga thu apieh thu, na suohte chientah a hil in ka um ua, tuaziehin noute zieha ka hinna uh taan ka zau seng seng ziehun tam sil kana bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh ngaivawi, tuin na khut ah ka um uhi, ka tung uah hoi le dih nasah bang bangin bawl mai in achi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n atung uah khumbangin abawla, tuachi’n Israel tate khut a kipat ahunkhie a, athat nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in khum niin amaute khu mipite ading leh aguotna muna Mangpa maitam a dinga sing puo leh tuitawi dingin apangsah a, tuni dongin apang nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hia, Jerusalem leengpa Adoni-Zedek in Joshua in Ai khuo alah a, asuhmang a, Jeriko khuo leh a leengpa tunga abawl bangin, Ai khuo leh a leengpa tungah zong abawlta hi; tualeh Gibeon a tengten Israelte toh kilemna abawlta ua, alah uah atengta uhi chi azahtah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a zauta mama hi, aziehpen Gibeon khuo pen leengpa khopite laha khopi lien khat bang leh Ai khuo sanga lienzaw ahi a, asunga teng zousie mihattah ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jerusalem leengpa Adoni-Zedek in Hebron leengpa Hoham, Jermuth leengpa Piram, Lakish leengpa Japhia leh Eglon leengpa Dabirte kungah mi asawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka kungah hing peitou unlen, Gibeonmite ithagam theina dingun hing panpi un, amauten Joshua leh Israel tate toh kilemna abawlta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin Amor mite leeng ngate, Jerusalem leengpa, Hebron leengpa, Jarmuth leengpa, Lakish leengpa leh Eglon leengpate akikhawm khawm ua, ama u’leh a galkap honpi utoh akuontou ua, Gibeon kho gal ah giehphuol abawl ua, adouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Gibeonmiten Gilgal a giehphuol ah Joshua kungah mi asawl ua, “Na suohte hing taisan vawt sin, kintahin ka kung uah hing peitou inlen, hing hundam inlen hing panpi in, aziehpen singtang gam a teng Amor mite leengte zousie koute dou dingin akikhawmta uhi,” ava chita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua leh akunga um galkap thei miteng leh mihat leh hangsan zousie Gilgal a kipat in akuontou ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua kungah, “Amaute giing vawt sin, na khut ah ka hing pedohta hi, na masangah mi khat zong ading ngam aum sih ding uhi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua thakhat in akung uah ahing tungta hi, zan khovah a Gilgal akipat a hing peitou ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Israelte masangah amaute asubuoi gawpta a, Gibeon khuo ah tampi athat a, tualeh Beth-Horon zottouna lampi ah adel a, Azekah leh Makkedah tan dongin athat toupeh nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Israelte masang akipat atai ua, Beth-horon zotsuhna lam a aum laiun, Mangpa’n van a kipat in gieltang lienpipi atung uah Azekah tandongin akesah a, ashita uhi. Israel taten namsau a atha sang un gieltang in a selia atamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Amor mite Israel tate apieh niin Joshuain Mangpa kungah thu agen a, Israelte mitmuin, “Ni, Gibeon khotungah ding den inlen, Ha, nang zong Aijalon guom ah um den in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten a melmate uh tunga phuba alahzou masangsie uh Ni ading den ta a, Ha zong akhawl denta hi. Tam thu khu Jasher laibu ah gel hilou ahiei mah? Tuachi’n ni khu vanlaizawl ah ading denta a, ni khat tungtawn tum ding vai ahawmta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa’n khumbanga mihing aw angaikhiet ni bangin, amasangin ni aum ngai mawngmawng sih a, Mangpa’n Israelte dingin adoupieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua leh Israelte zousie Gilgala a giehphuol uah akinuale sieng kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh khum leeng ngate ataimang ua Makedah leihawm ah akibuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tualeh leeng ngate Makedah leikohawm sunga kibu in akimudoh hi” chiin Joshua ahil ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in “Leikohawm kamah suong lien pipi lia unlen, aveng dingin mi koi un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noute umden sih unlen, na melmate uh nuadel unlen anualang vengte that unlen, akhopite uah lutsah vawt sih un, Mangpa na Pasian un amaute na khut uah ahing piehsa ahita hi”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing ahi a, Joshua leh Israel taten amaute athagam sieng masangsie uh hatha in athat ua, alah ua suohta teng khu kulbangnei khopite ah atailutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh mi zousie Makedah giehphuola Joshua kungah galmuong tahin ahing kinuale kia ua, koima’n Israel tate gensietna in aleiuh aloh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in “Leikohawm kam hong unlen, tua leeng ngate leikohawm a kipat ka kungah hing pui un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh amaun tambangin abawl ua, tua leeng ngate, Jerusalem leengpa, Hebron leengpa, Jarmuth leengpa, Lakish leengpa leh Eglon leengpa te leikohawm akipat in Joshua kungah ahing pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hi a, Tua leengte Joshua kunga ahing pui tahun, Joshua in Israel tate zousie ahankhawm a, amatoh kuontou galkap mite lah a lamkai deu deute kungah, “Hing nai unlen, tam leengte ngawng na kengun tuon un: achi a,” tuachi’n ahing pei ua angawnguh ahing totpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in akung uah, “Zau sih unlen lungke tuom sih un, hattah leh hangsan tahin um un, Mangpa’n tambangin na kidoupi na galte uh tungah abawl ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuazouin Joshua in amaute asat a, athatta hi, tualeh amaute sing dawn ah akhai a, tuachi’n nitahlam tandongin singdawn ah akikhai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahi a, nitum kuon in Joshua in thu apie a, singdawn akipat in alakhie ua, akibutna uh leikohawm ah apailut ua, aleihawm kam suong lien pipi in ahu ua, tuni tanin zong aum nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in khum niin Makedah khuo ala a, aleengpa uh nasan zong namsau in athat a, khum khuo ateng mi zousie khat zong khawilouin athatgam kilkel a, Jeriko leengpa tunga abawl bangin Makedah leengpa tungah zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua Israelte zousie toh Makedah a kipat in Libnah ah apei ua, Libnah ava kidoupita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n khum khuo a aleengpa nasan utoh, Israelte khut ah apekhe kia leuleu a, tuachi’n aman namsau hiem tahin a sunga teng zousie asatgama, khat zong ahinkhawita sih hi, Jeriko leengpa tunga abawl bangin, tam khuo leengpa tungah zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua khu Israelte zousie toh Libnah akipat in Lakish khuo lam ah apei ua, panmun akhaw ua, akidoupita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Lakish khuo khu Israelte khut ah apie a, aman ani ni niin tam khuo ala a, tualeh akho sunga mi um zousie namsau in asatlia sienga Libnah khotunga abawl bangin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gezer leengpa Horam khu Lakish khuo panpi dingin akuontou a, Joshua in ama leh amite khat beeh zong khawilouin athat gam sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Lakish akipat in Joshua khu Israelte zousie toh Eglon ah apei ua, panmun akhaw ua, akidoupita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh amauten khumni mama in tam khuo ala ua, namsau hiemtahin a satgamta uhi, tualeh asunga mihing um zousie Lakish tunga abawl bangbangin a un pi’n asumang sieng kilkel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua akunga um Israelte zousie toh Eglon khuo akipat in Hebron khuo lamah apei ua, ava kidoupita ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum khuo ala ua, aleengpa u’leh akhopi leh asunga teng mihing zousie toh namsau hiemin asat gam sieng uhi, Eglon khotunga abawl bangbangin khat beeh zong khawi louin akhuo nasan pumin asumang thai sienga, asunga um zousie toh asumangthai sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua leh Israelte zousie Debir ah a kuon kia ua, ava kidoupi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n ala ua, a leengpa leh akhopi zousie toh, tualeh namsau hiemin asatgam sieng ua, asunga um mihing zousie khat beeh zong hinkhawi louin asumangthang sieng uhi. Hebron tunga abawl bangbang in Debir tung leh aleengpa tungah abawla, Libnah khuo leh aleengpa tunga abawl bang in zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in gam pumpi abawn in, tanggam zousie, simlam gam zousie, muolhap gam ngiem zousie leh phai gam zousie leh a leengpate zousie uh athat gam a khat beeh zong hinkhawi louin, Israelte Mangpa Pasian thu pieh bangin hinna nei pouma asuchimit sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in amaute gam zousie Kadesh-Barnea akipat Gaza todongin, tualeh Goshen gam zousie, Gibeon tandongin azou a, alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tam leengte zousie leh agamte uh Joshua in khatvei thuin ala sieng hi; aziehpen Israelte Mangpa Pasian in Israelte adingin adoupieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua leh Israelte zousie Gilgala agiehphuol uah ahing kinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tamte zou in, Hazor leengpa Jabin in khum thute azah tahin, Madon leengpa Jobab leh Shimron leengpa tualeh Akshaph leengpate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh tang gam mallam a um leengte leh Kinneroth simlam Arabah leengte leh gam ngiem aum leengte, tualeh tumlam Dor gamgi zula um leengte kung leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suolam leh tumlam a um Kanaan mite kungah, tanggam aum Amormite leh Hitmite, Perizmite, Jebusmite leh Mizpah gam Hermon muol nuoi a um Hivmite kungah mi asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute a galkap honpite utoh mi atama tam, atam dan uh tuipi pieua, pieunel bang mai atam sakol leh sakolleng tampitoh akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tam leengte zousie ahing kimu khawmta ua, Israelte dou dingin, Merom tuite ah panmun akhawkhawmta uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Joshua kung ah, “Amaute, giing sin; zingchieng tuhun in, amaute a unpi un thaliasa in Israelte hing pe ding kahi ziehin, asakolte uh za nua na sattan pieh ding ua, asakollengte u’zong mei in na haltum pieh ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua leh agalkapte amauh doudingin Merom tuite ah thakhat in ahing tung phutta mai ua, theiloukal in aluonkhumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n amaute khu Israelte khut ah apekheta a, tuachi’n Israelten amaute athat gam ua, azouta ua, Sidon lien leh Meraphoth-Maim tandongin, tualeh suolam a Mizpah phaihawm dongin anuadel ua, khat mama zong suohta sahlouin athatgam sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n thu apieh bangin Joshua in atung uah abawl hi, asakol zanuate uh asat pieh ua, asakollengte uh mei in ahaltum pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh khum hunlai in Joshua akinua le a, Hazor khuo ala a, aleengpa uh namsauin athat a, aziehpen tumasang laiin Hazor khu khum leenggamte lah ah khopi pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh khum khuo a um mihing zousie athat sieng ua, asuchimit sieng ua, hinna nei pouma khat zong anuasie sih ua, Hazor khu mei in ahalta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum leengte khopite zousie leh aleengpate zousie uh Joshua in aman a, namsau hiemin asatlia sienga, tualeh Mangpa suoh Mosi in thu apieh bangin asumang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Hazor chilou muol tunga khopi na kibawl zousate zousie Israelten ahal sih ua, Hazor pen ahileh Joshua in ahalvam vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh tam khopite a gallah silte sum leh gantate zousie khu Israel taten amauh tantuom dingin akilah ua, hinanleh mihingte ahileh athagam masangsie un namsau hiemtahin a satlia sieng ua, hinna nei khat zong ahinkhawi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa’n asuoh Mosi thu apieh bang in, Mosi in Joshua thu apie a, tualeh Joshua in tuabangin abawl hi; Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh zousie bawllouin bangma anuasie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in khum gam zousie, singtang gam pumpi leh Negev gam sung zousie tualeh Goshen gam ngiem zousiete, Arabah gam zousie, Israel singtang gam leh gam ngiem leh aphaigamte utoh ala sieng kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Seir muol vasuntou Halak muol a kipat a Hermon tang nuoi a, Lebanon phaiguom a Baal-gad tandong in ala siengta hi, tualeh aleengpate zousie uh aman a, asata, athat siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joshua in khum leengte zousie sawtpi vei akidoupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gibeon khuo a teng Hivmite chilou, Israel tate toh lemna bawl khopi khat zong a umsih uhi; adangteng pen kidou a alah ngen uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh banga asuhchimit sienga, deisahna neivawt lou a, a suhmangthang theina ding ua alungtang uh asuhkhau pieh a, Israelte dousah zelpa lah Mangpa ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua tua hunlai in ahing kuon a, Anakimte singtang gam a pat in, Hebron akipat in, Debir akipat in, Anab akipat in tualeh Juda tanggam zousie akipat leh Israel tanggam akipat in Anakimte asatkhe sienga, Joshua in amaute akhopite u’toh asuchimit sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel tate gam ah Anakimte khat zong nuasie in a um sih hi. Gaza aleh Gath aleh Ashdod khuote ah aum nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Mosi kunga agen bangin Joshua in gam pumpi alata a, tualeh Joshua in Israelte anam uh kikhen dan dungzui zelin agouluo dingun ape chiet hi; Tuachi’n gam khu galmuongin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamte khu ahi Israel taten azaw uh, Jordan luigal lelam nisuohna lam a, Arnon lui a kipata Hermon muol tandong leh, suolam phaijang gam zousie a, agam uh aluo pieh uh leengte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Heshbon a tenga, tualeh Arnon luipanga um, Aroer a kipat leh luikim laia kipan leh Gilead gam kimkhat a kipan a Ammonmite gamgi zula um Jabbok lui tandonga vaihawm Amormite leengpa Sihon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Jordan phaijang suolam a kipat Kinneroth tuipi tandong ahia, tualeh suolam ah Beth-Jeshimoth zotna lampi lam a Arabah tuipi, Tuipi Al tandong ahia, tualeh simlam ah Pisgah muolpang ken bul tandong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Ashtaroth leh Edrei khuote a um Rephaim nam um sunte lah a Bashan leengpa Og in vai ahawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Hermon taang ah leh Salkah khuo leh Bashan gam zousie ah, Geshurmite leh Makathmite gamgi leh Gilead gam kimkhat tandongin, Heshbon leengpa Sihon gamgi tandongin vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa suoh Mosi leh Israel taten amaute athat ua, tualeh Mangpa suoh Mosi in Reuben namte, Gad namte leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah agoutan dingun ahawm pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamte khu ahi, Joshua leh Israel taten Jordan gal nitumna lampanga athate uh. Lebanon guom Baal-gad a kipat a Seir muol suntou Halak muol tandongin; Tualeh Joshua in Israel namte akikhen dan dungzui zel un khum gamte agouluo dingun ape chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua a gam kihop uh huop sung khu, singtang gamte, phai gamte, Phaijang gamte, muolpang ken leh zang kichin a gamte, gamdai gam, simlam gamte, Hitmite gam, Amormite gam, Kanaanmite gam, Perizmite gam, Hivmite gam leh Jebus mite gam zousie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aleengte u’khu, Jeriko leengpa, Bethel khopam a um Ai leengpa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem leengpa, Hebron leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jarmuth leengpa, Lakish leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eglon leengpa, Gezer leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Debir leengpa, Geder leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hormah leengpa, Arad leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Libnah leengpa, Adullam leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Makkedah leengpa, Bethel leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tappuah leengpa, Hepher leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aphek leengpa, Lasharon leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Madon leengpa, Hazor leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimron-meron leengpa, Akshaph leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tanak leengpa, Megiddo leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kadesh leengpa, Karmel-Jokneam leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dor gamgi zula Dor leengpa, Gilgal gam namte leengpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tirzah leengpa, Lengte zousie sawmthumle khat.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Joshua ahing tehta a, akum zong ahing tam mama ta a, tualeh Mangpa’n akungah, “Na tehta a, na kum zong atam ta hi, hinanleh gam lah ding lah atam mama nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gam lah nailou khu tamte ahi, Philistin gamgi zul zousie leh Geshuri gam zousie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izipt suolam aum Shihor apat mallam a Ekron gamgi tandongin (tam khu Kanaan mite gam a sim ahi.) Philistinte leeng ngate Gaza mite, Ashdod mite, Ashkelon mite, Git mite, Ekron mite gam leh Avim mite gam zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Simlam akipat Kanaan mite gam zousie leh Sidon mite gam Mearah akipat a Amormite gamgi zula Aphek tandongin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Gebal mite gam leh ni suohna lam Lebanon zousie Hermon tang nuoia um Baal-gad a kipat a Hamath kho lutna tandongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lebanon akipat Miserephoth-maim tandonga singtang gam a tengte zousie leh Sidon mite zousie Keima’n Israel tate masangah ka deldoh dinga, na kunga thu ka hing pieh tahmabangin nangman tamte Israel tate kungah agouluo dingun nahawm pieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin tam gam khu nam kuote leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah agouluo dingun hawm pieh ta in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Manasseh nam kimkhatte Reuben namte leh Gad namten Mangpa suoh Mosi in apieh bangin Jordan gal suolam pangah Mosi in amauh apieh a goutan uh ana tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Arnon luipanga um Aroer leh guom laizanga um khopi leh Medeba phaijang zousie a pat Debon dong leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Heshbon a teng Amormite leengpa Sihon khopi zousie Ammon mite gamgi tandongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Gilead leh Geshurmite leh Maakathmite gamgi leh Hermon Singtang gam zousie leh Bashan gam zousie Salkah tandongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ashtaroth leh Edrei a vaihawm Bashan a Og leenggam zousie toh (khum Rephaim nam umsunte ahi uh) aziehpen amauh Mosi in anadoulai a adeldohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel taten Geshurmite leh Maakath mite adeldoh sih ua, tuaziehin Geshur mite leh Maakath mite tuni tandongin Israel tate lah ah ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi namte kung bou ah gouluo ding ape sih a, aman a kung ua agensa bangin, Israelte Mangpa Pasian a dinga mei a sillatte khu amauh Goutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Reuben namte kungah ainnkuon dungzui in agoutan ding uh ana peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh gamgi khu Arnon luipanga um Aroer akipat a guom laizanga khopi leh Medeba kunga phaijang gam zousie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heshbon leh khum phaijang gam a khopi zousie, Debon, Bamoth-bal leh Bethbal-Meon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jahaza, Kedemoth leh Mephaath
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiriathaim, Sibmah, phaihawm gei a um Zereth-Sahar
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth-peor, Pisgah muolpangte leh Beth Jeshmothte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phaijang gam khopite zousie leh Heshbon a vaihawm Amormite leengpa Sihon leenggam zousie leh Mosi in ana thagamsa Midian leengte Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur leh Reba leenggam sunga teng Sihon leeng tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beor tapa Balaam aisan siempa zong Israel taten amithate lah uah, namsau in athat tel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben tate gamgi khu Jordan leh apang chieng ahi. Tamte khu Reuben tate dinga ainnkuon uh dung zui a, agoutan ding ua, khopite leh khoneute khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Gad namte kung ah zong a goutan ding uh ana pie a, Gad tate kung ngei ah, a innkuon dungzui in ana pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh agamgi u’khu Jazer leh Gilead gam khopi zousie leh Ammon mite gam kimkhat Rabbah suolam a Aroer tandong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Heshbon akipata Ramath-Mizpah leh Betonim dong, tualeh Mahanaim akipat in Debir gamgi tandong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Phaihawm lam ah Beth-aram leh Beth-nimrah, Sukkoth, Zaphon leh Heshbon leengpa Sihon leenggam dang teng toh Jordan lui khu agamgi ahia, Jordan ni suona lam a Kinnereth Tuipi tandong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamte khu Gad tate dinga a innkuon u’dungzui a goutan a anei uh khopite leh khoneute toh atan khawm uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah goutan ding apie a, Tamte khu a innkuon uh dungzui a, Manasseh nam kimkhatte goutan gam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Agamgi ukhu Mahanaim akipat in Bashan gam zousie, Bashan leengpa Og leenggam zousie leh Bashan a um Jair khopite zousie khopi sawmguh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Gilead gam kimkhat leh Bashan gam leengpa Og gam a Ashtaroth leh Edrei khuote khu Manasseh tapa Makir tate ainnkuon uh dungzui a Makir tate kimkhat tan dinga guot ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tamte khu Jeriko suolam a Jordan gal langkhat lam a, Moab phaijang a goutan dinga Mosi in ahawm gamte khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh Levi namte kung ah Mosi in goutan ding bangma ape sih hi, akung ua agensa bangin Israelte Mangpa Pasian khu agoutan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamte khu Israel taten Kanaan gam a aluo uh gamte: Siempu Eleazar leh Nun tapa Joshua leh Israel tate nam upaten, akung ua agoutan ding ua ahawm pieh u khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Mosi khut zanga thu apieh bangin, nam kuote ading leh nam kimkhatte dinga agoutan u’khu aisan a kihawm ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi in nam nite leh nam kimkhatte Jordan lui gal langkhat lam ah agoutan ding uh apeta a, hinanleh Levi mite kung ah goutan ape sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joseph tate khu nam ni, Manasseh leh Ephraim ahi ua, tualeh khum gam ah Levi tate khu tanvou pieh ahi sih uh; atenna ding uh khopite leh aganhonte uh tatna ding gamhingte leh aneilelamte uh koikhawmna ding adaikim te uh chilou akung uah tanvou bangma ape sih uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n Mosi thu apieh bangin, Israel taten abawl ua, gam khu ahawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda tate khu Gilgal ah Joshua kung ah ahing pei ua; tualeh Keniz mi Jephunneh tapa Kaleb in akungah, “Kadesh-Barnea mun a Pasian mipa Mosi kunga, Nang leh kei tungtang thu agen nathei hi, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa suoh Mosi in gam enkhe dinga Kadesh-Barnea apata ahing sawl laiin kum sawmli a upa kahi a, tualeh ka lungtanga um bangin akung ah thu ka nua tut kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh ka kuontoupi ka unauten mipite lungtang azunmang sah ua, hinanleh kenvang Mangpa ka Pasian nua dettah in ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum ni in Mosi akichiem a, tambangin agen hi: Na kengphang a na tot khahna gam pouma nang leh nahah nasuonte kumtawn goutan ahi ding hi, Mangpa na Pasian khu lungkelou a na zuizieh in, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Ngaiin, Mangpa’n Mosi kunga tam thu agen zou, Israelte gamdai a avahvai sungun, Mangpa’n agensa bangin kum sawmli leh kum nga tah ahing dam sah a, tuachi’n ngaiin tuni’n kum sawmgiet leh kumnga ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni dongin Mosi in ahing sawl ni a ka thahat ma bangin tuin zong kahat nalai hi; galdou dinga kuondoh ding leh vai tung dingin tuin zong kahat nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Mangpa’n khum ni a ana gensa tami muoltung gam khu hing peta in, aziehpen, khuna Anakimte a um dan uh, akhopite uh thupidan leh kulpi dettah a ki im khum ahi dan uh, khum niin na zata hi. Mangpa’n ahing umpi pouleh, Mangpa’n agensa bangin amaute ka notdoh zou ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in ama aguolzawl a, tualeh Jephunneh tapa Kaleb kungah agoutan dingin Hebron khuo apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin Hebron khuo khu tuni tandongin Keniz mi Jephunneh tapa Kaleb goutan ahita hi; aziehpen aman Israelte Mangpa Pasian nua dettahin a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Hebron min khu Kirjath-Arba ana kichi ahia, Arba khu Anakimte lah a, milientah ahi, tuachi’n gam khu galmuongin akhawlta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n tamte a innkuon uh dungzui a Juda namte tanvou ahi, simlam pangah Edom gamgi dongin, simlam gammong tawp Zin gamdai tan dong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh simlam panga a gamgi uh Tuipi Al mong tawpna a kipan ahia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simlam ah Akrabbim kaltouna dong aphasuh a, Zin gamdai zul zul ah Kadesh-Barnea simlam dongin ahing kihung tou a, Hezron ah asuohtou a, Addar ava pha a, Karkas kuol khum in akihei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Azmon ah apei zel a, Izipt luita ah asuohdoh a, Tuipi tan ah atawpta hi. Tam khu simlam panga na gamgi uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh suolampanga gamgi khu Tuipi-Al Jordan tunna laitah ahi a, tualeh mallam gamgi khu, Jordan luinah tuipi pangah akipan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamgi pen Beth-Hoglah ah atou pei a, Beth-arabah mallam ah asuoh a, tuachi’n Reuben tapa Bohan gamgi suongphu tan avapha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamgi khu Akor guom akipat in Debir ah a peitou a, tualeh mallam nawt in tua guom simlam ah Adummim kaltouna toh ki maingat aum Gilgal langah akihei a, tuachi’n gamgi khu En-Shemesh tuite azuisuh a, tuachi’n gamgi khu En-rogel ah asuoh khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamgi khu Hinnom tapa guom ah, Jebuste (Jerusalem ahi) gam pang simlam dongin apeitou a, tualeh gamgi khu Hinnom guom gal tumlam ah ahing kihung suh a, Rephaim guom sahlam a muol vum dongin a kihung phei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu muolvum a hing kipan in Nephtoah tuite dongin apeisah ua, Ephron muola khopite ah apei zel a, tuachi’n gamgi khu Baalah (Tua khu Kirjath-Jearim ahi) tandong avel suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi pen Baalah akipat in tumlam pang ah Seir muol dongin akihei kuol kia a, mallam pang ah Jearim (tuakhu kesalon ahi) muol zuiin mallam ah apeitou a, tualeh Beth-shemesh dongin akiheisuh kia a, tuachi’n Timnah azui suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gamgi khu Ekron mallam muol pangah apei a tuachi’n Shikkeron tandong ah akiviel a, tualeh Baalah muol a zui a, Jabneel ah apawt khie a, tuachi’n gamgi khu tuipi ah atawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh tumlampang gamgi pen tuipi Lien gei zul a, apieu tandong ahi, tami Juda tate a innkuon dungzui zel a atan uh gamgi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa’n Joshua kunga thu apieh bangin, tuin Joshua in Jephunneh tapa Kaleb kungah, Juda tate lah a agoutan tuom dingin Kirjath-Arba apie hi, tua khu Hebron zong akichi hi. (Arba kichipa khu Anak pa ahi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Kaleb in tuana kipat in, Anak tapa thumte, Sheshai, Ahiman leh Talmai kichi Anak tate adeldoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Khuna kipat in Debir khuo a mite vasim dingin a kuontou ua, Debir khu masanglai in Kiriath-Sepher akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Kaleb in “Koizong Kiriath-Sepher vasim a, vala zou pouma kungah ka tanu Aksa azi dingin ka pe ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kaleb sanggampa Kenaz tapa Othniel-in khum khopi ava lata a, tuachi’n aman atanu Aksa azi dingin apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Amanu apasal kung ahing tun in, apasal in apa kungah gam angen sahta a, tualeh a sabiltung tunga kipat akum a, Kaleb in amanu kungah “Bang dei na hiei” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amanu’n “Guolzawlna khat hing pie’n, simlam gam a na hing umsahtah ziehin tuinah neite zong hing pie’n” achi a. Tuachi’n Kaleb in tuinahnei sahta leh tuinahnei hangtate apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam khu a innkuon dungzui zel ua Juda tate kung a kipie agoutan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Simlang gam mong tandonga, Edom gamgi langa Juda namte khopi zousie khu Kabzeel, Eder leh Jagur ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kinah, Dimonah leh Adadah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kadesh, Hazor leh Ithnan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zipti, Telem leh Bealoth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazor, Hadattah, Kerioth leh Hezron, (tuakhu Hazor ahi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amam, Shema leh Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar, Gaddah Heshmon, Beth Pelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hazar, Shual, Beer-sheba leh Bizjothjah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Baalah, Ijim, Ezem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltolad, Chesil, Hormah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziglag, Madmannah, Sansannah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebaoth, Shillim, Ain, Rimmon: Khopite zousie leh kho neute toh a unpi’n sawmni leh kuo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />phaijang gamngiem ah: Eshtaol, Zoreah leh Ashnah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanoah, En-gannim, Tappuah leh Enam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jarmuth, Adullam, Sokoh leh Azekah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sharaim, Adithaim, Gederah leh Gederothaim, khopi sawm leh li akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zenan, Hadashah, Midgal Gad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dilean, Mizpah, Jokthel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lakish, Bozkath, Eglon
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kabbon, Lahmas, Kithlish.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gederoth, Beth Dagon, Namah leh Makkedah: Khopi sawm leh guh leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Libnah, Ether, Ashan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jiphtah, Ashnah, Nezib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keilah, Akzib leh Mareshah, khopi kuo leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ekron akhopite leh akhoneute toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ekron a kipat Tuipi tandongin Ashdod kung nai a um zousiete akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ashdod a khopite leh akhoneute toh, Gaza akhopite leh a khoneute toh, Izipt luita kunga tuipi Lien leh apang zulte toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh singtang gam a Shamir, Jattir leh Sokoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Dannah, Kirjath Sannah (tua khu Debir ahi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Anab, Eshtemoh, Anim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Goshen, Holon leh Giloh: khopi sawm leh khat akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Arab, Dumah, Eshean
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Janum, Beth Tappuah, Aphekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Humtah, Kirjath-Arba (tua khu Hebron ahi) leh Zior: khopi kuo leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Maon, Karmel, Ziph, Juttah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kain, Gibeah leh Timnah: khopi sawm leh a khoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Halhul, Beth-Zur, Gedor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Maarath, Beth-Anoth leh Eltekon: khopi guh leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Kirjath Baal (Kirjath-Jearim zong akichi hi) leh Rabbah: khopi ni a khoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Gamdai ah Beth-Arabah, Middin, Sekakah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nibshan, Chi khopi leh En-Gedi: khopi guh leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Jerusalem khuo a teng Jebus mite ahileh Juda taten a notdoh zou sih ua, tuachi’n Jebus mite khu tuni dongin Juda mite toh Jerusalem ah ateng khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Joseph tate tanvou dinga gam kipie khu; Jeriko kunga Jordan akipat in, gamdai suolam panga Jeriko tuinahte ah ahing suoh a; Jeriko akipat in singtang gam ah Bethel dongin apeitou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Bethela kipat in Luz ah asuoh a, Ark mite gamgi a Ataroth dongin apei zel a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tumlam panga Japhlet mite gamgi ah apeisuh a, Beth-Horon hangta zaw ah asuoh suh a Gezer tandongin apeisuh zel a, tuipi ah atawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joseph tate Manasseh leh Ephraim namten a goutan uh alata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh a innkuon uh dungzui a Ephraim tate gamgi pen tambang ahi, suo lampangah a goutan gamgi uh khu Ataroth-addar ahia, Beth-Horon sahta zaw tandongin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu tuipi mallam panga Mikmethath ah apei a, tualeh gamgi khu suolam a Tanath-Shilloh ah apei kuola, suolam a, Janoah ah apei zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Janoah apat in Ataroth ah leh Naarah ah apei suh a, Jeriko ahing sukha a, tualeh Jordan ah ahing suoh doh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gamgi khu tumlam a Tappuah apat in Kanah luita dongin apei zel a, Tuipi ah asuohdoh hi, tami a innkuon dungzui ua Ephraim tate goutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim tate khopi goutan tuomte khu Manasseh tate goutan lah ah aumta hi, khopi zousie leh akhoneute u’toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Gezer-a teng Kanaan mite khu adelmangta sih ua, tuachi’n Kanaan mite khu Ephraim mite lah ah tuni tandongin atengta ua, hinanleh pau bawlna toh nasep sah suohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh nam a dingin zong Goutan tuom khat a um hi; tuaziehin ama khu Joseph tapa upapen Makir, Gilead pa khu galhat mi ahiziehin, Gilead leh Bashan gam atangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Manasseh ta dangte adingin zong ainnkuon dungzui ua atan ding uh khat a um hi; Abiezar tate adingin, Helek tate adingin, Asriel tate adingin, Shekem tate adingin, Hepher tate adingin tualeh Shemida tate adingin, tamte khu a innkuon uh dungzui zel a Joseph tapa Manasseh tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Manasseh tapa, Makir tapa, Gilead tapa, Hepher tapa Zelophehad in tapa anei sih a, tanu maimai anei hi. Tualeh tamte khu atanute min ahi; Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milkah tualeh Tirzah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh ama ute khu Siempu Eleazar masang, Nun tapa Joshua masang leh lamkaite masang ah ahing pei ua, akung uah, ka unaute u’lah a goutan hing pe sam dingin “Mangpa’n Mosi kungah thu apie hi,” achi ua. Tuaziehin Mangpa thupieh dungzui in ama ute apa uh unaute lah ah Goutan ape samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jordan gal lelam a um Gilead leh Bashan chiloungal Manasseh in goutan sawm atangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Manasseh tanuten, atapate lah ah goutan anei ua, Manasseh tapa dangten Gilead gam atang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Manasseh gamgi khu Shekem suolam a um Asher akipata Mikmethath dong ahi, tualeh gamgi khu zietlam pangah En-tappuoh mite tenna dongin apei suh suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Manasseh in Tappuah gam atanga, hinanleh Manasseh gamgi zula um Tappuah pen Ephraim tate tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu Kanah luita, luita simlam ah a peikhesuh hi. Tam Ephraim khopite khu Manasseh khopite lah ah a um hi. Manasseh gamgi zong mallam pang ah a um hi. Tualeh Tuipi ah atung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simlam pang pen Ephraim a ahia, Mallam pang pen Manasseh a ahi; Tuipi khu agamgi ahi, mallam ah Asher tandong ahia, suolam ah Isaakar tandong ahi tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Isaakar leh Asher gam sungah Manasseh in Beth-Shean leh akim a khopite: Ibleam leh akima khopite, Dor a umte akim a khopite Endor-a umte leh akim a khopite, Taanak-a umte leh akim a khopite, Megiddo a umte leh akim a khopite, singtang gamkai thum anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Manasseh taten khum khopite a tengte anotdoh zou sih ua, tuachi’n Kanaan mite pen khum gam ah ateng denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Israel tate ahing hat vahiei tah un, Kanaan mite khu anuoi ua nasem dingin a guoi ua, hinanleh adeldoh sieng zou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Joseph taten Joshua kungah, “Bangchidan ahiei gouluo ding goutan sekhat leh tan khat maimai na hing pieh tuom, ka goutan tuom utoh, Mangpa’n lah tutan hatangpiin ahing guolzawl ngal a, mi zong tampi ka hita uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in amauh adawnga; “Mi tampi nahi u’leh, gammang gam ah peitou unlen Perizmite leh Rephaimte gam na umna dingun vala un, Ephraim tanggam pen noua dinga, neuseng taluo ahileh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Joseph taten “Singtanggam koua dingin ahun sih hi, tualeh phaijang gam a um Kanaan mite zousiein, Beth-Shean leh akhopi-a umte leh Jezreel phaihawm a umten sia-sakolleng anei chiet uhi” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joshua in Joseph innkuonte Ephraim leh Manasseh kungah, “Na tam mama ua hat zong nahat mama ua, tuaziehin tan khat mai mai tang sih va uteh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh tanggam nou a ahi ding hi, gammang singlah hinanleh na vat ding ua, agamgi mongtawp dongin naluo ding ua nou a ahi ding hi; aziehpen Kanaan miten sia sakolleng nei in hat mama nan u’leh zong amaute khu na notmang ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Israel hahlesuon mipi zousie Shiloh ah akikhawm ua, khum mun ah kimutuona biehbuh a tungdingta uhi, agam khu athunuoi uah a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate lah ah agoutan uh kipe nailou nam sagi a um nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in Israel tate kungah, “Mangpa napu leh pate uh Pasian in nou ahing piehsa gam luo dinga bangtan vei kiheh nalai ding nahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nam chinteng in mi thum chiet hing teldoh unlen, ken amaute ka sawl dinga, akuon ding ua, gam ava enkhe ding ua, agoutan ding uh dung zui in ahing giel ding ua, ka kungah ahing kile kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amaun mun sagi in ahawm ding ua, Juda tate simlam ah agoutanna mun uah a um ding, tualeh Joseph innkuonte mallam agoutanna mun uah a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin gam khu se sagi in na khen ding ua, tualeh na khenna uh hing pie unlen, Mangpa i Pasian uh masangah keiman ai kahing na sanpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Leviten na lah uah goutan anei sih ding uhi, Mangpa dinga siempu hina khu amauh goutan ahi. Tualeh Gad leh Reuben leh Manasseh nam kimkhatten, Mangpa suoh Mosi in amaute apiehsa Jordan gal suolam ah agoutan uh amuta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n mite khu akipankhie ua akuonta uhi, tualeh Joshua in gam khen dinga kuonte kungah, “Pei unlen gam vatuon suoh unlen, va khen un, tualeh Shiloh a Mangpa masanga nou a dinga ai ka hing sanpieh theina dingin, ka kungah hing kile kia un” chiin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh mite akuonta ua, gam ava tuonsuoh ua, se sagi in akhen ua, akhuo akhuo in laibu ah agiel khie ua, Shiloh giehphuol a Joshua kungah ahing pei kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in Shiloh ah Mangpa masangah ama ua dingin ai asanpieh a, tualeh Joshua in Israel tate kungah akikhenna dungzui un gam ahawm piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin namte dinga ai san khu a innkuon dungzuiun ahing pawtdohta a, agam tan ding ukhu Juda tate leh Joseph tate kikal ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh mallam ah agamgi u’khu Jordan akipan ahia, gamgi khu Jeriko siih-ah mallam pangah apeitou a, tualeh tumlam a singtang gamte ah apeitou a, Beth-aven gamdai ah atawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khuna kipat in Luz lamah, Luz khuo (tua khu Bethel ahi) dongin simlam nawt in apeisuh a, tualeh gamgi khu Ataroth-adar ah, Beth-horon hangta simlam panga um taang kawmah apeikhesuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh khuna kipat in gamgi akihei a, simlam Beth-horon ninga um muola kipat in tumlam a simlam pangah akuol phei a, Kirjath-Baal (tua khu Kirjath-Jearim ahi) Juda tate khopi ah atawp hi, khum khu tumlam pang gamgi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh simlam gamgi khu Kirjath-Jearim tawpna a kipan ahia, tumlam ah a suohdoh a, Nephtoah lui tuite ah ahing pawtdoh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu Rephaim mallam pang guoma, Hinnom tapa guom ninga muol mongah apei suh a, tuachi’n Jebusmite umna lampang Hinnom guom ah apei suh a, tualeh En-rogel-ah ahing kum suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh mallam zuon in akihei kawitou a, En-Shemesh dong apeitoua, Adumim katouna toh kigalsai lelam Gililoth tandongin apei a, tualeh Reuben tapa Bohan suongphu na dongin apei suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Arabah siih mallam ah apei zela, Arabah tandong apeisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamgi Beth-hogla ning mallam pangah apei zel a, tualeh gamgi hing suohdohna khu, simlam Jordan lui tawpna Tuipi Al pieu mallam ahi a, tua khu simlam gamgi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Jordan khu suolam panga agamgi ahi. Tami Benjamin tate a innkuon dung zui a, agoutan gam kuol sung uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n a innkuon uh dungzui a, Benjamin namte khopite khu Jeriko, Beth-hogla leh Emek-Keziz.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beth Arabah, Zemaraim leh Bethel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Avim, Parah leh Ophrah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kephar Hammoni, Ophni leh Gaba: khopi sawm leh ni leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon, Ramah leh Beeroth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpah, Chephirah leh Mozah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Rekem, Irpeel leh Taralah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zelah, Eleph, Jebus, (tua khu Jerusalem ahi) Gibeath leh Kirjath: khopi sawm leh li leh akhoneute toh, Tamte ainnkuon uh dungzui a Benjamin tate goutan dinga ki guot ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh aisan ni na khu Simeon a ding ahia, a innkuon uh dungzui a Simeon tate adingin ahing pawtdoh a, amauh goutan khu Juda tate goutan lah ah apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama uh goutan dingte, Beer-sheba, (Sheba) leh Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hazar-Shual, Balah leh Azem
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltolad, Bethur leh Hormah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziglag, Beth-Markaboth leh Hazar-Susah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth Lebaoth leh Sharuhen khopi sawm leh thum leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ain, Rimmon, Ether leh Ashan; khopi li leh akhoneute u’toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Baalath beer, Simlam a Ramath tandonga khopite kimvel a khoneu um zousie. Tamte a inn kuon uh dungzui a Simeon tate goutan gam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda tate goutan lah apat a Simeon tate goutan ahi: Juda tate goutan ding khu amauh innkuon dungzui in alien seng taluo hi, tuaziehin Simeon taten amauh goutan sungah, goutan anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ai san thumna khu ainnkuon uh dungzui a, Zebulun tate a dingin ahing suohdoh a, agoutan uh gamgi khu Sarid tandong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh agamgi u’khu tumlam ah Marala dongin apeitou zela, Dabeseth ava suntou a, tualeh Jokneam suolam a luita dong asuntou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sarid apat in suolam ah Kisloth-Tabor tandongin, ni suohnalam zuonin akihei a, tuachi’n Daberath ah asuohdoh a, Japhia ah apeitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh khuna kipat in suolam ah Gittah-hepher ah, Ittah-Kazin ah apei peh a, Remmon-methoar ah, tualeh Neah ah asuoh doh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi in mallam pangah Hannathon ah akihei kuol phei kia a, Jiphthah-El phaijangah atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Katath, Nahalal, Shimron, Idalah leh Bethlehem: khopi sawm leh ni leh akhoneute utoh zong apangkhawm hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamte khu ainnkuon uh dungzui a Zebulun tate goutan ahi, tam khopite leh akhoneute u’toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh aisan lina khu Issakar tungah, Issakar tate adingin ainnkuon uh dungzui in ahing suohdoh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh agamgi uh ahileh, Jezreel, Kesulloth, Shunem leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Haphraim, Shion, Anaharath leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rabbith, Kishion, Abez leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Remeth, En-gannim, En-haddah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh agamgi-in Tabor, Shahazimah leh Beth-Shemesh tandong asu a, tualeh agamgi uh Jordan ah ahing suohdoh hi: khopi sawm leh guh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamte ainnkuon uh dungzui a, Issakar tate goutan ahi, khopite leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ai san ngana khu ainnkuon uh dungzui in Asher nam hahlesuonte adingin ahing suohdoh kia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh agamgi u’khu Helkath, Hali, Beten leh Akshaph
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Alamelek, Amad, Misheal, ahia: tualeh tumlam ah Karmel leh Shihor-libnath tandong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh nisuohna lam ah Beth-dagon ah akiheia Zebulun leh Beth-emek leh Neiel lampanga Jiphthah-El phaihawm tandong asu tou a, veilam pangah Kabul ah asuohdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Hebron, Rehob, Hammon, Kanah leh Sidon thupi tandong ah apeitou zela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh gamgi khu Ramah leh kulpi nei Tai-ar khopi lam ah akihei phei a, tuachi’n gamgi khu Hosa ah akiheikuola gamgi khu Akzib gam kuol Tuipi ah atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Umah, Aphek leh Rehob zong ahia; khopi sawm leh ni leh akhoneute utoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tamte khu a innkuon uh dungzui a, Asher nam hahlesuonte goutan ahi, akhopite u’leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh ai san guhna khu a innkuon uh dungzui in Naphtali nam hah leh suonte a dingin, Naphtali tate tungah ahing pawtdoh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh agamgi u’khu, Heleph akipat, Zaananim a gangpi sing akipat, Adami Nekeb leh Janeel akipat Lukkum tandong ahi a, tualeh Jordan ah atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamgi khu tumlam pangah Aznoth-tabor ah apei suh a, khuna kipat in Hukkok ah apei a; Tualeh simlam pangah Zebulun ava tunga, tualeh ni suona lam ah Juda gam a Jordan dong ava pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh khopi kulpi neite khu Ziddim, Zer tualeh Hammath, Rakkath leh Kinnereth;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adamah, Ramah leh Hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kadesh, Edrei leh En-hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Iron, Migdol-el, Horem, Beth-anath leh Beth-Shemesh ahi a: khopi sawm leh kuo akhoneute u’toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tamte a innkuon uh dungzui a, Naphtali nam hahlesuonte goutan ahi; akhopite u’leh akhoneute u’toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh aisan sagina khu a innkuon uh dungzui in Dan nam hahlesuonte adingin ahing suohdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh agoutan uh gamgi khu Zorah, Eshtaol leh Ir-shemesh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Shaalabin, Aijalon leh Jethlah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Elon, Thimnathah leh Ekron,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Eltekeh, Gibbethon leh Baalath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehud, Bene-berek leh Gath-rimmon
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Me-jarkon, Rakkon leh Joppa toh kimaingat a um gamte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh Dan tate gamgi in tam munte ava hengtou a, Dan taten Lesem ava dou ua, ala ua, namsau in asumang ua, atangta uhi, tuachi’n khum munah ateng paita ua, apu uh Dan min phuo in Lesem khu Dan anachita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tamte khu Dan nam hahlesuonte ainnkuon uh dungzui a agoutan uh ahi, akhopite u’leh akhoneute utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun gam khu a goutan ding ua gamgi abawl bang dungzui un gam ana hawm zouta ua, tuachi’n Israel taten Nun tapa Joshua zong alah uah gam apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mangpa thupieh dungzui in amaun akhopi nget Ephraim singtang gam a um Timnath-Serah a pie uhi. Tualeh aman khopi abawl a, khunah a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tamte ahi Shiloh a, Kimutuona biehbuh kotpi bul a Mangpa masanga siempu Eleazar leh Nun tapa Joshua leh Israel tate lah a nam upa penten agoutan ding ua ai san a, ahawm gamte ukhu tamte ahi. Tuachi’n agam hawm uh a zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Joshua ahoupi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel tate kungah gen inlen, Mosi zanga na kung ua ka gensa bangin, nou a dingin kihumbitna ding khopite bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Koi zong tupna nei mawng hilou, thakhat thu a tuolthat khate khuna atailut theina dingun, tuachi’n nou a dingin sisan phubala mi lah a na kihumbitna uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh khum khopite khat penpen a atailut a, khopi kulpi kotkha bul ah avading dinga, khum khopi upate bil a zahngei in atungthu avatut dinga, tualeh amaun khopi sungah akung uah azawpi ding ua, alah ua aten theina ding in aumna ding a guotpieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh sisan phubala mi in ahing nuadel leh tuol that mi khu akhut ua ana pieh ding uh ahisih hi, aziehpen aman a innvengpa atup mawnga atha ahi sih hi, huotna zong anei sih hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh atungthu vaihawm piehna dinga mipi mai a adin masangsie leh khum hunlai a, um siempu lien shi mangsie khum khopi ah ateng ding hi. Tuazou chiengin tuolthat mi khu ahing taikhiehsan ama khopi leh, ama inn sung ah alut kia ding ahi, chiin gen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naphtali singtang gam a Galili ah Kadesh leh Ephraim singtang gam a Shekem leh Juda singtang gam a Kirjath-Arba (tua khu Hebron ahi) khopite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh suolam a Jeriko kunga Jordan gal lelampangah Reuben namte gam a Gilead a um Ramoth leh Manasseh namte gam a Bashan a um Golan a guotta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamte khu Israel tate zousie ading leh alah ua teng gamdangmite adinga, koipou tupmawng hilou a, mithat khate atailut ua, tualeh mipite masanga adin masang sie a sisan phubala mi khut a ashi louna dinga, kiguot khopite khu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levi namte lah a upa pente khu, siempu Eleazar leh Nun tapa Joshua leh Israel tate nam upa pente kungah ahing haw ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kanaan gam a Shiloh khuo ah: “Mangpa’n Mosi zangin ka umna ding uh khopite leh Kagantate uh tatna ding a kimvel gamte toh na hing pieh dinguh thu ana peta hi,” chiin ahing gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Mangpa thupieh bangin agoutan ua kipat in khum khopite leh akimvel gamte toh Levi namte apeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh ai san khu kohath mite innkuonte ading in ahing suohdohta a, tuachi’n Levi nam Aaron taten ai san in, Juda namte apat in, Simeon namte apat in tualeh Benjamin namte apat in khopi sawm leh thum atangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Kohath ta dangten Ephraim tate goutan akipat in, Dan namte goutan akipat in, Manasseh nam kimkhatte goutan akipat in khopi sawm ai san in atangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Gershon taten Issakar namte goutan akipat in, Asher namte goutan akipat in, tualeh Naphtali namte goutan akipat in leh Bashan gam a Manasseh nam kimkhatte akipat in, khopi sawm lethum atang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Merari taten a innkuon uh dungzui in Reuben namte goutan akipat in, Gad namte goutan akipat in, Zebulun namte goutan akipat in khopi sawm leh ni atang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Mangpa’n, Mosi zanga thu apieh bangin Levi mite kungah tam khopite leh akimvel gamte aisan in apeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Juda namte goutan akipat leh Simeon namte goutan akipat in tamna amin kigen khopite apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamte Levi tate lah a, Kohath innkuonte ahiziehun Aaron taten atang uhi; aziehpen ai san masapen khu ama ua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Juda singtang gam a Kijath-Arba khopi akimvel a gamte toh apia ua, tua Arba khu Anak pa ahi a (tuakhu Hebron ahi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh khopi kimvel gamte leh akhoneute khu Jephunneh tapa Kaleb kungah aluo dingin apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tambangin amaun siempu Aaron tate kungah Hebron leh akimvel gamte, Libnah leh akimvel gamte, tuolthat mi kihumbitna khopi dingin apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Jattir leh akimvel gamte, Eshtemoa leh akimvel gamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Holon leh akimvel gamte, Debir leh akimvel gamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ain leh akimvel gamte, Juttah leh akimvel gamte, Beth-shemesh leh akimvel gamte, toh, khum nam nite goutan akipat khopi kuote apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin nam akipat in Gibeon leh akimvel gamte, Geba leh akimvel gamte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anathoth leh akimvel gamte, tualeh Almon leh akimvel gamte toh: khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron tate siempute khopi zousie, khopi sawm leh thum leh akimvel gamte chiet toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kohath tate lah a um nalai, Levi mite Kohath tate innkuonten, Ephraim nam apat in aisan in atan dinguh khopite atang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun akung uah, Ephraim singtang gam a Shekem leh akimvel gamte toh, tualeh Gezer leh akimvel gamte khu tuolthat mite dinga kihumbitna khopi dingin apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Kibzaim leh akimvel gamte, Beth-horon leh akimvel gamte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Dan nam apat in Eltekeh leh akimvel gamte Gibbethon leh akimvel gamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aijalon leh akimvel gamte, Gathrimmon leh akimvel gamte: khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Manasseh nam kimkhat apat in, Taanak leh akimvel gamte, Gath-rimmon leh akimvel gamte toh khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohath tate umnalaite a dinga, khopi zousie khu khopi sawm leh, akimvel gamte toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Levi mite innkuon a Gershon tate kungah Manasseh nam kimkhatte goutan akipat, tuolthat mite kihumbitna khopi, Bashan gam a um Golan leh akimvel gamte toh tualeh Be-estera leh akimvel gamte toh: khopi ni apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Issakar namte goutan akipat in, Kishion leh akimvel gamte, Debareh leh akimvel gamte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jarmuth leh akimvel gamte, En-gannim leh akimvel gamte toh; khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Asher namte goutan a kipat in, Mishal leh akimvel gamte, Abdon leh akimvel gamte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Helkah leh akimvel gamte, Rehob leh akimvel gamte toh khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Naphtali namte goutan akipat in, Galili gam a Kadesh leh akimvel gamte, Hammoth-dor leh akimvel gamte, tualeh Kartan leh akimvel gamte toh, tuolthat mite kihumbitna khopi hi dingin: khopi thum apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A innkuon uh dungzui a, Gershon mite khopi zousie khu khopi sawm leh thum leh akimvel gamte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Levimi um nalai Merari tate innkuonte kung ah, Zebulun namte Goutan apat in, Jokneam leh akimvel gamte, Kartan leh akimvel gamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimnah leh akimvel gamte, Nahalal leh akimvel gamte; khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben namte goutan a kipat in, Bezer leh akimvel gamte, Jahazah leh akimvel gamte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedemoth leh akimvel gamte, Mephaath leh akimvel gamte; khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Gad namte goutan a kipat in Gilead a um Ramoth leh akimvel gamte, Mahanaim leh akimvel gamte khu tuolthat mite kihumbitna khopi hi ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Heshbon leh akimvel gamte, Jazer leh akimvel gamte abawn in khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levite innkuonte lah a um nalaite, ainnkuon dungzui ua, Merari tate adinga khopi kiguot aisan a atan uh khopite sawm leh ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel tate gam luo sunga Levi mite khopi zousie khu sawm li leh giet leh akimvel gamte toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tam khopiten akimvel gam akinei chiet ua, tam khopite hichi bang ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n apulepate u’kunga pieh dinga ana chiemsa gam zousie Israel tate apeta a, tuachi’n khum gam aluo ua, atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh apulepate uh kunga akichiemna zousie bang dungzui in Mangpa’n amaute khawldamna apeta a; agalte zousie uh, koima amai ua pangthei mawngmawng a um sih uhi. Mangpa’n agalte zousie uh akhut uah apekhe siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mangpa’n Israel innkuonte kunga silhoi ana gen zousie atangtunglou khat beeh a um sih a, atangtung sieng kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in Reuben mite, Gad mite leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte ahan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh akung uah Mangpa suoh “Mosi in na kung ua thu ahing pieh zousie na zuita ua, tualeh thu ka hing pieh pouma nouten zong na zuizel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuni tandongin, ni tampi, na unaute uh na nuasie sih ua, hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un bawl dinga ahing thupiehte na bawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin, Mangpa na Pasian un akung ua ana chiemsa mabangin na unaute uh khawldamna apeta hi; tuaziehin, Mangpa suoh Mosi in Jordan gal lelam a na goutan ding ua ahing piehsa gam a na puon inn lamte uah nuapei kiata un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa suoh Mosi in, Mangpa na Pasian uh it a, alampi zousie zui a, athupiehte pom a, Ama bel chinten a, na lungtang zousie u’leh na hinna zousie ua, Ama nna na seppieh theina ding ua, ahing thupiehte leh adan thute ngaisah ding in pilvang mama un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in amauh a guolzawla, asawldoh ta hi; tualeh amaute apuon inn lam uah apeisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Manasseh nam kimkhatte Mosi in Bashan ah gam luo ding ana peta a, akim khat dangte pen Joshua in Jordan gal tumlam panga aunaute lah ah gam luo ding apie hi. Tualeh Joshua in amau’te a innlam ua apeisah ding kuon in aguolzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kung uah, “Na puon innte uah hausatna tampi toh, ganhon tampi toh, Dangka, Sana leh sum-eng toh, sia tampi leh nihten puonsil tampi toh, nuapei kiata unlen, na gallah silte uh na unaute u’toh kihawm dildiel un,” chiin avaihah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Reuben tate, Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte akinuale kiata ua, Kanaan gam a um Shiloh khuo ah, Israel tate toh akikhen ua, Mangpa’n Mosi zanga thu ana pieh bangin, agam luo ding uh Gilead gam lam a, pei dingin akipandohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Kanaan gamsunga um Jordan lui a gamgi ahing tun un, Reuben tate, Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatten khunah Jordan luigei ah maitam lienpi leh lunglut huoitah khat alam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten “Ngai un, Reuben tate, Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatten Kanaan gamgizul Jordan lui gei, Israel tate luona gam lam ah maitam khat abawl uhi,” chi a kigen azata ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten tam thu azah tah un, Israel tate mipi zousie, amauh dou tumin Shiloh khuo ah akikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Gilead gam a Reuben tate leh Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah siempu Eleazar tapa Phinehas a sawl ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama toh Israel nam zousie apat innsunga upapen leh lamkai lien chiet sawm asawlkhawm uhi; amaute khu namte innkuon sunga upa pente chiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Gilead gam a Reuben tate, Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah avahaw ua, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa mipi kikhawmte zousie in tambangin achi uhi; “Tunia Mangpa tunga na hel theina ding ua, maitam na bawl ua, tunia Mangpa Israelte Pasian zuilou a, kiheimang san dinga, silsie bawla leptat na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peor mun a itatsietnate uh ei a dinga huntalou amah? Mangpa mipi kikhawmte lah a gawtna atun zieh a tuni tan a zong khum khelnate apat isiengthou nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh tunia Mangpa na zui na ua kipata kiheimangsan na tup tahtah uh amah? Mangpa tunga hel nahi u’leh hichi ahi ding hi; zing chiengin Israel mipi kikhawm zousiete tungah Ama alungthah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh na gam luo uh abua leh, Mangpa biehbuh umna, Mangpa gam luona mun ah hing pei galkai unlen, koute lah ah goutan hing nei mai un, hinanleh Mangpa i Pasian uh maitam chilou maitam dang bawlin, Mangpa tungah hel sih unlen, koute tungah zong helsih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zerah tapa Akan in hamselaw sil tunga atatkhel zieh a Israel mipite zousie tunga lungthahna tung hilou ahiei mah? tualeh agitlouna ah ama maimai ashi sih hi,” chiin ava gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben tate leh Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatten adawng ua, Israel nam lah a upa pente kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mangpa pasiente Pasian, Mangpa, pasiente Pasian Aman athei hi, tualeh Israelte mama in zong thei u’hen; ka maitam bawl uh Mangpa kiheimangsan tum a hel tupna ahiei, ahisihleh sil bawlkhiel tupna ahiei a, bawl kahi u’leh tuni’n zong hing hinkhawi da mai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa zuiloua kiheimangsan na ding ahiei, ahisihleh, halmang sillat ahiei, neh ding sillat ahiei, latna dinga, ahisihleh, lemna sillat latna dinga maitam bawl kahi u’leh Mangpa mama in aphu hing la maileh asih diei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tunua chiengin nahah nasuonte un, ka hah kasuonte uh kungah, nouten Israelte Mangpa Pasian toh bang kizopna na nei uoi? achi khah ding uh ka zau zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nou Reuben tate leh Gad tate aw, Mangpa’n noute leh koute Jordan lui gamgi in abawlta hi; Mangpa ah tan bangma nanei sih uhi, ahing chi kha ding ua, tuachi’n na tate un, ka tate uh, Mangpa agiinna uh asuh tawp pieh khah ding uh zauna zieh a, zieh neitah a kabawl uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin Tuin kisa un maitam ibawl ding uh, halmang sillat latna ding leh kithoina ding zong hilou in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh ka halmang sillatte u’leh, ka kithoinate u’leh ka lemna sillatte utoh, Mangpa nna ka septheina dingun leh tunua chienga na tate un ka tate uh kunga “Mangpa ah nouten tan bangma na neisih uh, achilouna ding ua, kou leh nou kikaal a, tua leh inua chienga ihah-isuonte kikaal a, theipitu hi zaw dingin ka chi ua ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin hichi ahi dinga, tunua chienga ka kung uh ahiei, ka hah ka suonte uh kung ahiei a, khumbanga ahing chi hun chieng ua, kouten, En ve ua ka pule pate un Mangpa maitam bangbang khat abawl uh, halmang sillatna ding leh kithoina hilouin kou leh nou kikaal a, theipitu ahi kachi theina ding ua, ka bawl uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abiehbuh mai a um Mangpa i Pasian uh maitam chilou ngal, halmang sillatna ding ahiei, nehding sillatna ding ahiei, ahisihleh kithoina ding ahiei a, maitam bawla, ka ut dan ua helna bawla Mangpa elngatsan a ka umna ding u’pen agamla mama hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh siempu Phinehas leh akunga um mipi tunga vaihawmte, Israel nam chinte upa penten Reuben tate leh Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte thu gen azah tahun akipah mama ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh siempu Eleazar tapa Phinehas in Reuben tate, Gad tate leh Manasseh nam kimkhat te kungah, Mangpa tunga sil na bawl khellou ziehun, “Tuin Mangpa ilah uah a um nahi chi ka theita uhi, tuachi’n Israel tate Mangpa khut akipat na hunkheta uhi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Eleazar tapa Phinehas leh miliente khu Gilead gam a Reuben tate leh Gad tate kunga kipat in, Kanaan gam a Israel tate kungah anua pei kia ta ua, akung uah thu ahing tut kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh khum thuten Israel tate akipahsah mama a, tuachi’n Israel taten Pasian aphatta uhi; tuachi’n Reuben tate leh Gad tate tenna gam suse dinga, vakidoupi ding in kuon asawm nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben tate leh Gad taten maitam min khu Theipitu achi uhi. “I kikaal ua Mangpa khu Pasian ahi chi theipitu ahitah ding ziehin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tauleh hichi ahi a, hun sawtpi nua in Mangpa’n Israel tate kunga a kimvel ua amelmate ua kipata tawldamna apieh nuain, Joshua ahing tehta a, ahing upa mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in Israel mi zousie leh a upate u’leh a lamkaite uh, avaihawmte u’leh a upate uh ahan sah a, akung uah, “Kei pen ka tehta a, ka upa mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un noute zieha tam namte zousie tunga abawl dan na muta uhi, aziehpen nou a dinga hingdou piehpa khu Mangpa na Pasian uh, Ama mama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En un, Keima’n tua um nalai namte, Jordan akipat a nitumna lam a Tuipi Lien tandonga ka suhmang sa nam zousie pumin na namte uh gouluo dingin ai san in ka hing hawmpiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un, na masang uah amauh anotdoh dinga, na muphah louna uah adelmang sieng ding hi, tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian un na kung ua ahing chiemsa bangin agam uh naluo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mosi dan laibu a kigiel zousie, zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei a, na pielsan vawt louna dingun hangsan tahin zui unlen bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tam nam na lah ua um nalaite toh kizahallou a, a pasiente uh min zong lou lou a na kichiem lou ua, ana u’zong semlou a, amasang ua kun a na bieh louna ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh tuni tandonga na bawl mabang un Mangpa na Pasian uh tukip chinten un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n na masang ua pat in nam thupi leh hattahte ahing deldoh piehta hi, hinanleh tuni tandongin noute masangah koima ading zou a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lah ua mi khat in tul khat na delzah ding ua, aziehpen na kung ua akichiemsa mabangin Mangpa na Pasian un nou a dingin ahing doupieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian uh it dingin pilvang mama un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuchilou a, bang chi ahiei a, na leengatsan ua, na lah ua kinuasie den tam nam dang um sunte na bel ua, tualeh amaute toh zi leh ta a na kiten ua amaute lah a nalut ua, ama u’zong noute lah a ahing lut u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un na masang ua pat in tam namte ahing deldoh pieh nawn sih dinga: Mangpa na Pasian un ahing piehsa tam gam hoitah akipat na manthai masangsie uh, amaute noute a dingin piel leh thang leh na elduong ua dingin satna chieng leh na mit ua dingin ling ahing hi zawding uhi chi, chientahin thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tualeh ngaiun, tuni’n leitung pumpi ngaina dan bangin ka shi hun ahing tungta hi. Mangpa na Pasian un na kung ua agensa sil hoi zousie zong alawsam sih chi na lungtang zousie leh na hinna zousie un na thei uhi, abawn in na tung uah ahing tangtung sienga khat zong apelhem a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin hichi ahi dinga, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing chiem sil hoi zousie na tung ua ahingtun siengtaah mabangin, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh tam gam hoitah a kipata ahing suhmang sieng masangsie Mangpa’n sil hoilou zousie na tung uah ahing tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un zuidinga ahing pieh Thuhun na pal siet ua, pasien dangte nna na sep pieh ua, na bieh ua, amasang ua na kuntah chiengun Mangpa lungthahna na tung uah akuongdoh dinga, na kung ua ahing pieh gam hoi akipat na mangthang ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in Israel nam zousie Shekem ah ahankhawm a, Israel nam upate leh alamkaite u’leh, a vaihawmte leh athukhente, uh ahan sah a, tuachi’n Pasian mai ah ahing peikhawm chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in mipite zousie kungah, “Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi. Napu leh pate uh nidang laiin tuipi gal lelam ah ana teng ua, Tera Abraham leh Nahor pa te ngel zong: Tualeh ama u’ten pasien dangte ana bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n keiman na pu uh Abraham khu khum luigal lelam akipat ka hankhie a, Kanaan gam sung teng ah ka pui kawi kawi a, ahahlesuonte ka pungsah a, Isaak ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Isaak kungah Jakob leh Esau ka pie a, tualeh Esau kungah agoutan dingin Seir singtang gam ka pie a, tualeh Jakob leh atate pen Izipt ah apeisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuazouin Mosi leh Aaron zong ka sawl a, Izipt gam khu ka silbawltheina lamdang toh ka gawta, tuachi’n noute ka hing puidoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt gam a kipat in napu leh pate uh ka puidohta a, tualeh tuipi na hing tung ua, tuachi’n Izipt miten napu leh pate uh kangtalai leh sakoltung tuong mite toh tuipi san tandong ahing nua del uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Mangpa ahanta ua, tuachi’n Aman noute leh Izipt mite kikaal ah miel ahing koita a, tualeh amau’te tuipi in atuomsah a, atummangta uhi. Tualeh Izipt gam a ka silbawl na mit ngel un amu a. Tuachi’n gamdai ah sawtpi na um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Jordan luigal lelam a um Amor mite gam ah noute ka hing puilut a, amaun ahingna dou ua, tuachi’n agam uh naluo theina ding un amau’te na khut uah ka hing pekhie hi, tualeh na masang uah amaute ka sumangthang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Moab leengpa Zippor tapa Balak ahing kisa a Israelte ana kidoupi a, tualeh nou hing hamsiet dingin Beor tapa Balaam han dingin mi asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Balaam thu ka ngaikhe nuom sih a, tuaziehin nou ahing guolzawl zawta hi, tuachi’n akhut a kipat in ka hing hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jordan na galkai ua, Jeriko ah na hing tung uhi, tualeh Jerikomiten ahing dou ua, Amormite, Periz mite, Kanaanmite, Hitmite, Girgashmite, Hivmite leh Jebusmiten zong ahing dou uhi. Hinanleh amaute na khut uah ka hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh na masang uah tunpi ka sawl a, tuaten na masang uah amaute leh Amormite leeng nite adelmang ta uhi. Hinanleh na namsaute u’leh na thalpi uh ahiei ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh na sepkhiet uh hi vawtlou gam leh nabawl uh hivawtlou khopite ka hing pie a, asung ah na teng uhi; na suonlou kei uh grep huon a agate leh Olive huona agate nane uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tuin Mangpa giing unlen, gin umna leh thutah toh Ama nna sem unlen, napu leh pate un Lui gal leh Izipt gam a ana anasep uh pasiente paimang unlen, Mangpa na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa nasep khu nou adinga sil hoilou banga na gel u’leh koi nna ahiei nasep ding uh tuni’n tel mai un; napu leh pate un Lui gal a a nna asep uh pasiente nna ahiei, ahisihleh agam sung ua na ten na uh Amormite pasiente nna ahiei nasep dinguh, hinanleh keileh ka innkuonpiten vang Mangpa nna ahi ka sep ding uh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten adawng ua, pasien dangte nna sem dingin “Mangpa ka taisan vawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa i Pasian uh Ama ngel khu Izipt gam a isaltaanna inn a kipat a eite leh ipu leh pate uh hing puidohpa leh imitmua, chiemtena thupi bawla ipeina lam zousie leh inawh peisuoh mipite zousie lah a hing vengbitpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n imasang ngel ua kipat in nam chin tua gam a um Amormite ngel adeldoh sienga, tuaziehin kouten zong Mangpa nna ahi ka sep ding uh Ama lah ka Pasian uh ahi ngal a achi ua,” adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Joshua in mipite kungah, “Mangpa nna nasem thei sih ding uhi, Ama Pasian siengthou ahi a, thangsiet hat Pasian ahia, Aman na tatkhelnate u’leh na khelnate uh a ngaidam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nouten Mangpa na taisan ua, gamdang pasiente nna nasep u’leh vang, na tung ua sil hoi abawl nuain, kihei in na tung uah silsie bawl in ahing sugam ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten Joshua kungah, “Hilou e, kouten Mangpa nna ka sem ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in mipite kungah, Ama nna sem dingin “Mangpa na telta uhi chi theipite nouma mama nahi uhi,” achi a, tualeh amaun “Theipite kahi uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aman tuin, “Na lah ua gamdang pasien umte koimang unlen, Mangpa Israelte Pasian langah na lungtang uh hei un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh mipiten Joshua kungah, “Mangpa i Pasian nna ka sem ding ua, athu ka zui ding uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in tua niin mipite toh thuhun abawl a, Shekem ah ama ua dingin danthu leh vaihawmna dante aguot pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in tam thute Pasian dan laibu ah agiellut a, tualeh suong lienpi khat ala a, Mangpa mun siengthou kunga gangpi sing nuoi ah aphut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh mipi zousiete kungah, “Ngai un, tam suong ithu hing theipitu hi hen, aziehpen tami’n Mangpa’n ikung ua athu gen zousie azata hi, tuaziehin tami na thu uh hing theipitu ahi ding hi, tuachilou in na Pasian uh na kitheimaw bawlkha ding uhi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua in mipite khu amauh goutan gam chiet uh zuon in akikhen sah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh tam silte nua in hichi ahing hi a, Mangpa suoh Nun tapa Joshua kum za leh kum sawm a upa ahiin ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Gaash muol mallampang, Ephraim singtang gam a ama goutan gamgi sunga Timnath-Serah ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua dam sung leh upate khup a damsawt zawte dam sung leh Mangpa’n Israelte a ding a, asil bawl zousie theipi mite dam sungin Israelten Mangpa nna asem zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Izipt a kipat a ahing puoh uh Joseph gute khu, Shekem pa Hamor tate a kipat a Jakob in dangka zakhat a, aleina mun Shekem ah avuita uhi. Tualeh khum khu Joseph tate goutan ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron tapa Eleazar ashi a, tualeh Ephraim singtang gam atapa dinga apiehna mun uh atapa Phinehas khopi Gibeah ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
